#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:2
msgid "ANPHON: Theoretical background"
msgstr "ANPHON: 理論的背景"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:8
msgid "Dynamical matrix"
msgstr "動力学行列 (dynamical matrix)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:10
msgid "The dynamical matrix is given by"
msgstr "動力学行列は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:12
msgid ""
"D_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))\\right]},"
msgstr ""
"D_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))\\right]},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:18
msgid ""
"where :math:`M_{\\kappa}` is the atomic mass of atom :math:`\\kappa`. By "
"diagonalizing the dynamical matrix, one can obtain :math:`m` "
"(:math:`=3N_{\\kappa}`) eigenvalues "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}`  (:math:`j = 1, 2, \\dots, m`) and"
" corresponding eigenvectors :math:`\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` "
"for each :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` point. Here, "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` is a column vector consisting "
"of atomic polarization :math:`e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)`. Let "
":math:`D(\\boldsymbol{q})` denote a matrix form of equation :eq:`dymat`, "
"the eigenvalues may be written as"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`M_{\\kappa}` は原子 :math:`\\kappa` の原子質量です。動力学行列を対角化することで、各 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` 点について :math:`m` (:math:`=3N_{\\kappa}`) 個の固有値 "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}`  (:math:`j = 1, 2, \\dots, m`) "
"と対応する固有ベクトル :math:`\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` が得られます。ここで "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` は原子分極 "
":math:`e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)` "
"からなる列ベクトルです。:math:`D(\\boldsymbol{q})` を式 :eq:`dymat` "
"の行列形式とすると、固有値は次のように書けます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:23
msgid ""
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2} = "
"(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}} "
"D(\\boldsymbol{q})\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}."
msgstr ""
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2} = "
"(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}} "
"D(\\boldsymbol{q})\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:28
msgid ""
"Next, we introduce :math:`m\\times m` matrices :math:`\\Lambda` and "
":math:`W` which are defined as :math:`\\Lambda(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\mathrm{diag} "
"(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}1}^{2},\\dots,\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}m}^{2})` "
"and :math:`W(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}1},\\dots,\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}m})`,"
" respectively. Then, equation :eq:`omega2` can be denoted as"
msgstr ""
"次に、:math:`\\Lambda(\\boldsymbol{q}) = \\mathrm{diag} "
"(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}1}^{2},\\dots,\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}m}^{2})` "
"および :math:`W(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}1},\\dots,\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}m})`"
" でそれぞれ定義される :math:`m\\times m` 行列 :math:`\\Lambda` と :math:`W` "
"を導入します。すると、式 :eq:`omega2` は次のように表せます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\Lambda(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"W^{\\dagger}(\\boldsymbol{q})D(\\boldsymbol{q})W(\\boldsymbol{q})."
msgstr ""
"\\Lambda(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"W^{\\dagger}(\\boldsymbol{q})D(\\boldsymbol{q})W(\\boldsymbol{q})."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:39
msgid "Non-analytic correction"
msgstr "非解析補正 (non-analytic correction)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:41
msgid ""
"When one needs to capture the LO\\-TO splitting near the zone-center, it "
"is necessary to account for the long\\-range correction to the dynamical "
"matrix. In the **anphon** code, three different approaches are "
"implemented: the Parlinski's method [Parlinski1998]_ (``NONANALYTIC = "
"1``), the mixed-space approach [Wang2010]_  (``NONANALYTIC = 2``), and "
"the Ewald summation method (``NONANALYTIC = 3``)."
msgstr ""
"ゾーン中心付近の LO\\-TO 分裂を捉える必要がある場合、動力学行列に対する長距離補正を考慮する必要があります。**anphon** "
"コードでは、3 つの異なる手法が実装されています。Parlinski の方法 [Parlinski1998]_ (``NONANALYTIC = "
"1``)、混合空間アプローチ (mixed-space approach) [Wang2010]_  (``NONANALYTIC = "
"2``)、および Ewald 和 (Ewald summation) 法 (``NONANALYTIC = 3``) です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:44
msgid ""
"The first two methods are rather simple and add the non-analytic part of "
"the dynamical matrix with different weighting factors. The non-analytic "
"part of the dynamical matrix is defined as"
msgstr "最初の 2 つの方法は比較的単純で、動力学行列の非解析部分を異なる重み係数で加えるものです。動力学行列の非解析部分は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:47
msgid ""
"D_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{NA}}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
"\\frac{4\\pi e^{2}}{V} "
"\\frac{(Z_{\\kappa}^{*}\\boldsymbol{q})_{\\mu}(Z_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}^{*}\\boldsymbol{q})_{\\nu}}{\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\epsilon^{\\infty}\\boldsymbol{q}},"
msgstr ""
"D_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{NA}}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
"\\frac{4\\pi e^{2}}{V} "
"\\frac{(Z_{\\kappa}^{*}\\boldsymbol{q})_{\\mu}(Z_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}^{*}\\boldsymbol{q})_{\\nu}}{\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\epsilon^{\\infty}\\boldsymbol{q}},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`V` is the volume of the primitive cell, "
":math:`Z_{\\kappa}^{*}` is the Born effective charge tensor of atom "
":math:`\\kappa`, and :math:`\\epsilon^{\\infty}` is the electronic "
"dielectric permittivity tensor, respectively."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`V` は基本セル (primitive cell) の体積、:math:`Z_{\\kappa}^{*}` は原子 "
":math:`\\kappa` の Born 有効電荷テンソル (Born effective charge "
"tensor)、:math:`\\epsilon^{\\infty}` は電子誘電率テンソル (electronic dielectric "
"permittivity tensor) です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:56
msgid "Parlinski's approach (``NONANALYTIC = 1``)"
msgstr "Parlinski のアプローチ (``NONANALYTIC = 1``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:58
msgid ""
"In the Parlinski's approach [Parlinski1998]_ , the total dynamical matrix"
" is given by"
msgstr "Parlinski のアプローチ [Parlinski1998]_ では、全動力学行列は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:60
msgid ""
"D(\\boldsymbol{q}) + "
"D^{\\textrm{NA}}(\\boldsymbol{q})\\exp{(-q^{2}/\\sigma^{2})},"
msgstr ""
"D(\\boldsymbol{q}) + "
"D^{\\textrm{NA}}(\\boldsymbol{q})\\exp{(-q^{2}/\\sigma^{2})},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\sigma` is a damping factor (``NA_SIGMA``). :math:`\\sigma`"
" must be chosen carefully so that the non-analytic contribution becomes "
"negligible at Brillouin zone (BZ) boundaries. Too large :math:`\\sigma` "
"can result in a discontinuity of phonon dispersion at the BZ boundaries, "
"while too small :math:`\\sigma` can yield a large oscillation of the LO "
"phonon frequencies as going away from :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0`. So, an "
"appropriate :math:`\\sigma` value needs to be chosen in an *ad hoc* way."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\sigma` は減衰係数 (``NA_SIGMA``) です。:math:`\\sigma` は、ブリルアンゾーン "
"(Brillouin zone, BZ) 境界で非解析的寄与が無視できる程度になるよう慎重に選ぶ必要があります。:math:`\\sigma` "
"が大きすぎると BZ 境界でフォノン分散が不連続になることがあり、小さすぎると :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` "
"から離れるにつれて LO フォノン振動数が大きく振動することがあります。したがって、適切な :math:`\\sigma` の値を *アドホック*"
" に選ぶ必要があります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:70
msgid "Mixed-space approach (``NONANALYTIC = 2``)"
msgstr "混合空間アプローチ (``NONANALYTIC = 2``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:72
msgid ""
"In the mixed-space approach [Wang2010]_ , the total dynamical matrix is "
"given by"
msgstr "混合空間アプローチ [Wang2010]_ では、全動力学行列は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:74
msgid ""
"D(\\boldsymbol{q}) + "
"D^{\\textrm{NA}}(\\boldsymbol{q})\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))\\right]}."
msgstr ""
"D(\\boldsymbol{q}) + "
"D^{\\textrm{NA}}(\\boldsymbol{q})\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))\\right]}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:78
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The second term vanishes at the :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` points "
"commensurate with the supercell except for the :math:`\\Gamma` point "
"(:math:`\\boldsymbol{q} = 0`). No adjustable parameters exist in this "
"approach. In many cases, the mixed-space approach gives reasonable "
"dispersion curves. However, it can still yield a discontinuity in the "
"phonon dispersion at BZ boundaries when the boundary point is "
"incommensurate with the supercell size."
msgstr ""
"第 2 項は、:math:`\\Gamma` 点 (:math:`\\boldsymbol{q} = 0`) を除いて、スーパーセル "
"(supercell) と整合する :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"点で消えます。このアプローチには調整可能なパラメータはありません。多くの場合、混合空間アプローチは妥当な分散曲線を与えます。しかし、境界点がスーパーセルのサイズと整合しない場合には、BZ"
" 境界でフォノン分散に不連続が生じることがあります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:84
msgid "Ewald method (``NONANALYTIC = 3``)"
msgstr "Ewald 法 (``NONANALYTIC = 3``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:86
msgid ""
"The Ewald summation technique [Gonze1997]_ is more accurate and therefore"
" recommended in general. In this method, we first decompose the harmonic "
"force constants computed in a supercell into the long\\-range dipole-"
"dipole (DD) components and the short\\-range ones as follows"
msgstr ""
"Ewald 和の手法 [Gonze1997]_ はより正確であり、そのため一般に推奨されます。この方法では、まずスーパーセルで計算された調和力定数"
" (harmonic force constants) を、長距離の双極子-双極子 (dipole-dipole, DD) "
"成分と短距離成分に次のように分解します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:89
msgid ""
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{SR}}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})="
" \\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime}) - "
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{DD}}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})."
msgstr ""
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{SR}}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})="
" \\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime}) - "
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{DD}}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:94
msgid ""
"After the short\\-range components are obtained, they are used in "
"equation :eq:`dymat` to obtain the short\\-range dynamical matrix "
":math:`D_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{SR}}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q})`."
" Then, the total dynamical matrix is constructed as"
msgstr ""
"短距離成分が得られた後、それらを式 :eq:`dymat` に用いて短距離動力学行列 "
":math:`D_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{SR}}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q})`"
" を求めます。次に、全動力学行列を次のように構成します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:96
msgid ""
"D_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"D^{\\mathrm{SR}}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) +  "
"D^{\\mathrm{DD}}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q})."
msgstr ""
"D_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"D^{\\mathrm{SR}}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) +  "
"D^{\\mathrm{DD}}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q})."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:100
msgid ""
"The long\\-range terms, "
":math:`\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{DD}}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})`"
" and "
":math:`D^{\\mathrm{DD}}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q})`,"
" can be calculated from :math:`\\epsilon^{\\infty}` and "
":math:`Z_{\\kappa}^{*}` using the Ewald summation technique."
msgstr ""
"長距離項 "
":math:`\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}^{\\mathrm{DD}}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})`"
" および "
":math:`D^{\\mathrm{DD}}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q})`"
" は、Ewald 和の手法を用いて :math:`\\epsilon^{\\infty}` と :math:`Z_{\\kappa}^{*}` "
"から計算できます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:102
msgid ""
"To include the non-analytic correction with ``NONANALYTIC > 0``, one also"
" needs to give ``BORNINFO``."
msgstr "``NONANALYTIC > 0`` で非解析補正を含めるには、``BORNINFO`` も指定する必要があります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:106
msgid "Irreducible representations and IR/Raman activity (``IRREPS = 1``)"
msgstr "既約表現と赤外/ラマン活性 (``IRREPS = 1``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:108
msgid ""
"At the zone center, every space-group operation "
":math:`\\{S|\\boldsymbol{v}\\}` acts on the mass-weighted polarization "
"vectors through the :math:`3N_{\\kappa}\\times 3N_{\\kappa}` matrix"
msgstr ""
"ゾーン中心では、すべての空間群操作 :math:`\\{S|\\boldsymbol{v}\\}` は、質量で重み付けされた分極ベクトルに対して "
":math:`3N_{\\kappa}\\times 3N_{\\kappa}` 行列"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:111
msgid ""
"T_{\\mu\\nu}(S;\\kappa^{\\prime}\\kappa) = "
"S_{\\mu\\nu}\\,\\delta_{\\kappa^{\\prime},S(\\kappa)},\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"T_{\\mu\\nu}(S;\\kappa^{\\prime}\\kappa) = "
"S_{\\mu\\nu}\\,\\delta_{\\kappa^{\\prime},S(\\kappa)},\n"
"\n"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:114
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`S(\\kappa)` is the atom onto which :math:`\\kappa` is "
"mapped; the fractional translation :math:`\\boldsymbol{v}` contributes no"
" phase at :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0`, so the representation is an ordinary"
" representation of the crystal point group. For each set :math:`\\lambda`"
" of degenerate modes, the character"
msgstr ""
"を通して作用します。ここで :math:`S(\\kappa)` は原子 :math:`\\kappa` が写される先の原子です。部分並進 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}` は :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` "
"では位相を与えないため、この表現は結晶点群の通常の表現になります。縮退したモードの各集合 :math:`\\lambda` に対して、指標 "
"(character)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:119
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\chi_{\\lambda}(S) = \\sum_{j\\in\\lambda}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{e}_{j}^{\\dagger}\\, T(S)\\, \\boldsymbol{e}_{j}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\chi_{\\lambda}(S) = \\sum_{j\\in\\lambda}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{e}_{j}^{\\dagger}\\, T(S)\\, \\boldsymbol{e}_{j}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:123
msgid ""
"is a class function, and the multiplicity of the irreducible "
"representation :math:`\\mu` in :math:`\\lambda` follows from the "
"orthogonality relation"
msgstr ""
"は類関数 (class function) であり、:math:`\\lambda` に含まれる既約表現 :math:`\\mu` "
"の重複度は直交関係"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:126
msgid ""
"n_{\\mu}(\\lambda) = \\frac{1}{g\\,c_{\\mu}} \\sum_{S} "
"\\chi_{\\lambda}(S)\\,\\chi_{\\mu}(S)^{*},\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"n_{\\mu}(\\lambda) = \\frac{1}{g\\,c_{\\mu}} \\sum_{S} "
"\\chi_{\\lambda}(S)\\,\\chi_{\\mu}(S)^{*},\n"
"\n"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`g` is the order of the point group and :math:`c_{\\mu}` "
"accounts for the time-reversal pairing of complex-conjugate one-"
"dimensional representations (:math:`c_{\\mu}=2` for the paired "
":math:`E`-type representations of the groups :math:`C_{3}`, "
":math:`C_{4}`, :math:`C_{6}`, :math:`S_{4}`, :math:`S_{6}`, "
":math:`C_{3h}`, :math:`C_{4h}`, :math:`C_{6h}`, :math:`T`, :math:`T_{h}`,"
" and :math:`c_{\\mu}=1` otherwise). A multiplet is infrared active when "
"its representation appears in the vector representation "
":math:`\\Gamma_{V}` (characters :math:`\\operatorname{tr}S`), and Raman "
"active when it appears in the symmetric square "
":math:`[\\Gamma_{V}\\otimes\\Gamma_{V}]_{s}` (characters "
":math:`(\\operatorname{tr}^{2}S + \\operatorname{tr}S^{2})/2`). The "
"analysis uses the analytic dynamical matrix, i.e. the labels refer to the"
" :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\rightarrow 0` limit without the direction-"
"dependent non-analytic correction."
msgstr ""
"から求まります。ここで :math:`g` は点群の位数、:math:`c_{\\mu}` は複素共役な 1 "
"次元表現が時間反転によって対をなすことを考慮する因子です (点群 :math:`C_{3}`, :math:`C_{4}`, "
":math:`C_{6}`, :math:`S_{4}`, :math:`S_{6}`, :math:`C_{3h}`, "
":math:`C_{4h}`, :math:`C_{6h}`, :math:`T`, :math:`T_{h}` の対をなす :math:`E` "
"型表現では :math:`c_{\\mu}=2`、それ以外では :math:`c_{\\mu}=1`)。多重項 (multiplet) "
"は、その表現がベクトル表現 :math:`\\Gamma_{V}` (指標 :math:`\\operatorname{tr}S`) "
"に現れるとき赤外活性であり、対称平方 :math:`[\\Gamma_{V}\\otimes\\Gamma_{V}]_{s}` (指標 "
":math:`(\\operatorname{tr}^{2}S + \\operatorname{tr}S^{2})/2`) "
"に現れるときラマン活性です。この解析には解析的な動力学行列を用います。すなわち、ラベルは方向依存の非解析的補正を含まない "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\rightarrow 0` 極限に対応します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:142
msgid ""
"When ``BORNINFO`` is given, the infrared oscillator-strength tensor of a "
"multiplet is also computed from the mode effective charges "
":math:`Z^{*}_{\\nu,\\alpha} = \\sum_{\\kappa\\beta} "
"Z^{*}_{\\kappa,\\alpha\\beta}\\, "
"e_{\\beta}(\\kappa;\\nu)/\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}}` as"
msgstr ""
"``BORNINFO`` が与えられている場合、多重項の赤外振動子強度テンソルも、モード有効電荷 "
":math:`Z^{*}_{\\nu,\\alpha} = \\sum_{\\kappa\\beta} "
"Z^{*}_{\\kappa,\\alpha\\beta}\\, "
"e_{\\beta}(\\kappa;\\nu)/\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}}` から次式で計算されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:147
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"S_{\\alpha\\beta}(\\lambda) = \\sum_{\\nu\\in\\lambda} "
"Z^{*}_{\\nu,\\alpha} Z^{*}_{\\nu,\\beta},\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"S_{\\alpha\\beta}(\\lambda) = \\sum_{\\nu\\in\\lambda} "
"Z^{*}_{\\nu,\\alpha} Z^{*}_{\\nu,\\beta},\n"
"\n"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:150
msgid "which is invariant under rotations within the degenerate subspace."
msgstr "これは縮退部分空間内の回転に対して不変です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:155
msgid "Group velocity"
msgstr "群速度 (group velocity)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:157
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The group velocity of phonon mode :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` is given by"
msgstr "フォノンモード :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` の群速度は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:159
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = \\frac{\\partial "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{q}}."
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = \\frac{\\partial "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{q}}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:163
msgid ""
"*anphon* evaluates it from the **velocity matrix** (default) or by a "
"**finite difference**."
msgstr ""
"*anphon* はこれを **速度行列** (velocity matrix) から (デフォルト)、または **有限差分** (finite "
"difference) によって評価します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:166
msgid "Velocity matrix (default)"
msgstr "速度行列 (デフォルト)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:168
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Let :math:`\\tilde{D}(\\boldsymbol{q})` denote the dynamical matrix whose"
" phase factor carries the full interatomic separation rather than the "
"lattice vector alone,"
msgstr ""
"格子ベクトルだけでなく原子間の相対位置全体を位相因子に含む動力学行列を :math:`\\tilde{D}(\\boldsymbol{q})` "
"とします。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:171
msgid ""
"\\tilde{D}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})"
"\n"
"\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell\\kappa))\\right]}."
msgstr ""
"\\tilde{D}_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})"
"\n"
"\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell\\kappa))\\right]}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:178
msgid ""
"It is related to :eq:`dymat` by the unitary transformation "
":math:`\\tilde{D}(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"U^{\\dagger}(\\boldsymbol{q})D(\\boldsymbol{q})U(\\boldsymbol{q})` with "
":math:`U_{\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime}}(\\boldsymbol{q})=\\delta_{\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime}}\\,e^{i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\kappa)}`,"
" so it has the same eigenvalues :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}`, "
"and its eigenvectors are "
":math:`\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{e}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}=U^{\\dagger}(\\boldsymbol{q})\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`."
" The band off-diagonal generalization of the group velocity [Allen1993]_ "
"[Simoncelli2022]_ is"
msgstr ""
"これは式 :eq:`dymat` とユニタリ変換 :math:`\\tilde{D}(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"U^{\\dagger}(\\boldsymbol{q})D(\\boldsymbol{q})U(\\boldsymbol{q})` (ただし "
":math:`U_{\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime}}(\\boldsymbol{q})=\\delta_{\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime}}\\,e^{i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\kappa)}`)"
" で結ばれているため、同じ固有値 :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}` を持ち、その固有ベクトルは "
":math:`\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{e}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}=U^{\\dagger}(\\boldsymbol{q})\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`"
" です。群速度のバンド非対角への一般化 [Allen1993]_ [Simoncelli2022]_ は"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:185
msgid ""
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu} = "
"\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}}}"
"\n"
"(\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{e}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\tilde{D}(\\boldsymbol{q})}{\\partial q_{\\mu}} "
"\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{e}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'},"
msgstr ""
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu} = "
"\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}}}"
"\n"
"(\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{e}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\tilde{D}(\\boldsymbol{q})}{\\partial q_{\\mu}} "
"\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{e}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:192
msgid ""
"whose diagonal :math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\mu}` is the group "
"velocity. It is :math:`\\tilde{D}`, not :math:`D`, that must be "
"differentiated: the two derivatives differ by "
":math:`i\\,[\\,D,\\,\\mathrm{diag}(r_{\\mu}(\\kappa))\\,]`, whose matrix "
"elements between eigenvectors carry the factor "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}^{2}`. "
"The diagonal and any element inside a degenerate multiplet are therefore "
"the same for both, but genuinely off-diagonal elements --- those entering"
" the :ref:`coherent term <kappa_coherent>` --- are not (the "
"*displacement-aware* convention of Ref. [Simoncelli2022]_)."
msgstr ""
"であり、その対角成分 :math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\mu}` が群速度です。微分すべきは :math:`D` "
"ではなく :math:`\\tilde{D}` です。両者の微分は "
":math:`i\\,[\\,D,\\,\\mathrm{diag}(r_{\\mu}(\\kappa))\\,]` "
"だけ異なり、その固有ベクトル間の行列要素は因子 "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}^{2}` "
"を持ちます。したがって対角成分および縮退多重項内部の要素は両者で一致しますが、真に非対角な要素 --- :ref:`コヒーレント項 "
"<kappa_coherent>` に入る要素 --- は一致しません (文献 [Simoncelli2022]_ の "
"*displacement-aware* な規約)。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:198
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For polar systems the non-analytic correction (``NONANALYTIC = 1, 2, 3``)"
" contributes to :math:`\\partial\\tilde{D}/\\partial\\boldsymbol{q}`. It "
"is obtained by a central difference of the assembled non-analytic matrix "
"together with the derivative of the sublattice phase factor relating "
":math:`D` and :math:`\\tilde{D}`; omitting the latter corrupts even the "
"diagonal velocities. At :math:`\\Gamma` the non-analytic velocity is not "
"defined without a directional convention and is set to zero. On a band "
"path the derivative uses the same direction vector as the eigenproblem "
"for that segment."
msgstr ""
"極性系では、非解析的補正 (``NONANALYTIC = 1, 2, 3``) が "
":math:`\\partial\\tilde{D}/\\partial\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"に寄与します。これは、組み立てた非解析的行列の中心差分と、:math:`D` と :math:`\\tilde{D}` "
"を結ぶ副格子位相因子の微分とを合わせて求められます。後者を省略すると、対角成分の速度さえ誤ったものになります。:math:`\\Gamma` "
"点では、方向に関する規約なしには非解析的な速度が定義できないため、ゼロに設定されます。バンド経路上では、その区間の固有値問題と同じ方向ベクトルを微分に用います。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:205
msgid ""
"At exactly :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` the three acoustic modes are uniform"
" translations whose frequencies vanish by the acoustic sum rule, and "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}` with :math:`j` or :math:`j'` among "
"them is :math:`0/0`. Velocity-matrix elements are set to zero wherever a "
"frequency is below :math:`10^{-8}` Ry, but a small sum-rule residual can "
"leave these modes just above it, and their elements are then amplified "
"without bound (e.g. in polar crystals without inversion). The "
"translational modes are therefore identified at :math:`\\Gamma` as the "
"three eigenvectors with the largest weight in the span of the mass-"
"weighted uniform translations :math:`t_{\\alpha}(\\kappa "
"i)\\propto\\sqrt{m_{\\kappa}}\\,\\delta_{i\\alpha}`, independently of "
"their frequencies, and their rows and columns of the velocity matrix are "
"set to zero, including the coherent elements with optical modes; their "
"finite-difference velocities (zero by time reversal up to roundoff) are "
"set to zero as well. This applies to the transport terms and to "
"``PRINTVEL``. It is a convention for the single point "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0`, not a sound velocity: sound velocities follow "
"from :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\neq0`. The adaptive smearing widths are left"
" unchanged."
msgstr ""
"厳密に :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` では、3 "
"つの音響モードは一様な並進であり、その振動数は音響和則によりゼロになるため、:math:`j` または :math:`j'` がそれらに含まれる "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}` は :math:`0/0` となります。速度行列の要素は振動数が "
":math:`10^{-8}` Ry "
"を下回るところではゼロに設定されますが、和則のわずかな残差によってこれらのモードがそのすぐ上に残ることがあり、その場合それらの要素は際限なく増幅されます"
" (例えば反転対称性のない極性結晶)。そこで :math:`\\Gamma` 点では、振動数によらず、質量で重み付けした一様並進 "
":math:`t_{\\alpha}(\\kappa "
"i)\\propto\\sqrt{m_{\\kappa}}\\,\\delta_{i\\alpha}` が張る空間への重みが最も大きい 3 "
"つの固有ベクトルを並進モードとして特定し、光学モードとのコヒーレント要素も含めて、速度行列のそれらの行と列をゼロに設定します。これらのモードの有限差分速度"
" (時間反転により丸め誤差を除いてゼロ) もゼロに設定されます。これは輸送に関する項と ``PRINTVEL`` に適用されます。これは単一の点 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` に対する規約であり、音速ではありません。音速は "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\neq0` から得られます。適応スメアリングの幅は変更されません。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:216
msgid ""
"Inside a degenerate multiplet :math:`\\mathcal{B}` the eigenvectors are "
"fixed only up to a unitary rotation, so the individual "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\mu}` are not defined; only block traces "
"such as :math:`\\sum_{j,j'\\in\\mathcal{B}} "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu}` are. How the "
"transport terms use this is described in :ref:`the Peierls-term section "
"<kappa_peierls>`."
msgstr ""
"縮退多重項 :math:`\\mathcal{B}` の内部では固有ベクトルはユニタリ回転の自由度を除いてしか定まらないため、個々の "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\mu}` "
"は定義されず、:math:`\\sum_{j,j'\\in\\mathcal{B}} "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu}` "
"のようなブロックのトレースのみが定義されます。輸送に関する各項がこれをどのように用いるかは :ref:`Peierls 項の節 "
"<kappa_peierls>` で説明します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:221
msgid ""
"On a uniform mesh the velocity operator is averaged over the little group"
" :math:`G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` of :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` before it is "
"projected onto the eigenvectors: over the operations :math:`R` of the "
"space group used for the k-point reduction with "
":math:`R\\boldsymbol{q}=\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{G}`, and, combined "
"with time reversal, those with "
":math:`R\\boldsymbol{q}=-\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{G}`. With "
":math:`M^{\\mu}=\\partial\\tilde{D}/\\partial q_{\\mu}` in the atomic "
"Cartesian basis and :math:`T(R)` the transformation of the displacement "
"field (atom permutation, rotation and cell phase),"
msgstr ""
"一様メッシュ上では、速度演算子は固有ベクトルに射影される前に :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` の小群 "
":math:`G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` について平均されます。すなわち、k 点の削減に用いる空間群の操作 :math:`R` "
"のうち :math:`R\\boldsymbol{q}=\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{G}` "
"を満たすもの、および時間反転と組み合わせて "
":math:`R\\boldsymbol{q}=-\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{G}` "
"を満たすものについて平均します。原子のデカルト基底での :math:`M^{\\mu}=\\partial\\tilde{D}/\\partial"
" q_{\\mu}` と、変位場の変換 (原子の置換、回転、セルの位相) :math:`T(R)` を用いると、"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:227
msgid ""
"M^{\\mu} \\leftarrow \\frac{1}{|G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}|}\\sum_{R\\in "
"G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}}\\sum_{\\nu}R_{\\mu\\nu}\\,\n"
"T(R)\\,M^{\\nu}\\,T(R)^{\\dagger},"
msgstr ""
"M^{\\mu} \\leftarrow \\frac{1}{|G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}|}\\sum_{R\\in "
"G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}}\\sum_{\\nu}R_{\\mu\\nu}\\,\n"
"T(R)\\,M^{\\nu}\\,T(R)^{\\dagger},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:232
msgid ""
"where an antiunitary element enters as "
":math:`-[T(R)M^{\\nu}T(R)^{\\dagger}]^{*}`. The :math:`T(R)` form a "
"representation of :math:`G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` up to phases, which cancel,"
" so this is an exact projector that does not involve the eigenvectors or "
"the degeneracies, and it leaves an operator that already has the symmetry"
" unchanged. It matters with ``NONANALYTIC = 1, 2``: their non-analytic "
"term depends on the direction of :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` itself, so the "
"dynamical matrix is not periodic, and on the zone boundary the velocities"
" would depend on which of the equally short images "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{G}` the mesh keeps and break the "
"crystal symmetry (e.g. a nonzero :math:`\\kappa_{xy}` in a cubic "
"crystal). The eigenvectors at such a point are those of the one image "
"used and are not symmetrized."
msgstr ""
"ここで反ユニタリな要素は :math:`-[T(R)M^{\\nu}T(R)^{\\dagger}]^{*}` "
"として入ります。:math:`T(R)` は位相を除いて :math:`G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` "
"の表現を成し、その位相は打ち消し合うため、これは固有ベクトルや縮退を含まない厳密な射影演算子であり、すでに対称性をもつ演算子は変化させません。これは"
" ``NONANALYTIC = 1, 2`` の場合に重要になります。これらの非解析項は :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"の方向そのものに依存するため動力学行列は周期的ではなく、ゾーン境界では、等しく短い周期像 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{G}` "
"のうちどれをメッシュが保持するかに速度が依存し、結晶の対称性が破れてしまいます (例えば立方晶での非ゼロの "
":math:`\\kappa_{xy}`)。そのような点での固有ベクトルは、用いた 1 つの周期像のものであり、対称化されません。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:240
msgid ""
"Two limitations remain. First, the average acts on each mesh point "
"separately and does not make the velocities of different members of a "
"star consistent with each other. Where all equally short images of "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` are related by :math:`G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` "
"(simple cubic and tetragonal lattices) this follows; where they are not, "
"as on the edges where two hexagonal faces of the fcc Brillouin zone meet,"
" an anisotropy of order :math:`10^{-6}` of :math:`\\kappa` can remain "
"with ``NONANALYTIC = 1, 2`` (e.g. zincblende BAs on a "
":math:`20\\times20\\times20` mesh). Second, the statement that the "
"conductivity uses only block traces is exact only for exactly degenerate "
"blocks: blocks are formed with a tolerance of :math:`10^{-6}` cm\\ "
":sup:`-1`, the heat capacity is evaluated with each branch's own "
"frequency, and the coherent term uses the individual frequencies of the "
"pair."
msgstr ""
"2 "
"つの制限が残ります。第一に、平均は各メッシュ点に対して個別に作用し、スターの異なるメンバーの速度を互いに整合させるものではありません。:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}`"
" の等しく短い周期像がすべて :math:`G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` で結ばれている場合 (単純立方格子および正方格子) "
"は整合性が自動的に成り立ちますが、そうでない場合、例えば fcc ブリルアンゾーンの 2 "
"つの六角形の面が接する稜上では、``NONANALYTIC = 1, 2`` で :math:`\\kappa` の "
":math:`10^{-6}` 程度の異方性が残ることがあります (例: :math:`20\\times20\\times20` "
"メッシュでの閃亜鉛鉱型 "
"BAs)。第二に、熱伝導率がブロックのトレースのみを用いるという記述は、厳密に縮退したブロックに対してのみ正確です。ブロックは "
":math:`10^{-6}` cm\\ :sup:`-1` "
"の許容値で形成され、熱容量は各分枝自身の振動数で評価され、コヒーレント項は対の個々の振動数を用います。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:250
msgid "Finite difference"
msgstr "有限差分"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:252
msgid ""
"The finite-difference group velocity is obtained from a central "
"difference,"
msgstr "有限差分による群速度は、次の中心差分から得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:254
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} \\approx "
"\\frac{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}+\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}j} - "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}-\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}},"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} \\approx "
"\\frac{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}+\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}j} - "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}-\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:258
msgid ""
"where :math:`j` is the index in the *sorted* eigenvalue list at each "
"shifted point. Wherever branches cross or are degenerate the sorted index"
" exchanges character between "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}` and the quotient "
"connects two different branches. Finite-difference velocities are used by"
" the adaptive smearing widths (``ISMEAR = 2``) and by the iterative "
"Boltzmann solvers, which have not been reformulated. At a mesh point with"
" a nontrivial little group they are symmetrized as well: inside a "
"degenerate block the central difference of sorted eigenvalues pairs the "
"branches and is not a vector, so each block is first replaced by its "
"mean, which approximates "
":math:`\\mathrm{Tr}(P_{\\mathcal{B}}v^{\\mu}P_{\\mathcal{B}})/d`, and the"
" result is projected onto the invariant vectors, "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}\\leftarrow|G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}|^{-1}\\sum_{R}(\\pm"
" R)\\boldsymbol{v}` (minus sign for the time-reversal partners). The "
"block mean is a trace approximation and is used only where the velocity "
"enters transport as a vector (the iterative and direct Boltzmann solvers "
"and the velocities written to the result files). The adaptive smearing "
"widths keep the unaveraged differences, because they are built from "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{j}\\pm\\boldsymbol{v}_{j'}|` per branch, and two"
" opposite slopes in a block give a nonzero width although their mean "
"vanishes; the 3ph linewidths are therefore unchanged. At a mesh point "
"with a trivial little group nothing is done, so an accidental degeneracy "
"there keeps the pairing of the sorted branches."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`j` は各シフト点における *ソートされた* "
"固有値リストのインデックスです。分枝が交差または縮退するところでは、ソートされたインデックスの性格が "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\Delta\\boldsymbol{q}` の間で入れ替わり、差分商は 2 "
"つの異なる分枝を結びつけてしまいます。有限差分の速度は、適応スメアリングの幅 (``ISMEAR = 2``) "
"と、まだ定式化し直されていない反復ボルツマンソルバーで用いられます。非自明な小群をもつメッシュ点では、これらも対称化されます。縮退ブロック内では、ソートされた固有値の中心差分は分枝を対にしてしまいベクトルにならないため、まず各ブロックをその平均で置き換え"
" (これは :math:`\\mathrm{Tr}(P_{\\mathcal{B}}v^{\\mu}P_{\\mathcal{B}})/d` "
"を近似します)、その結果を不変ベクトルに射影します: "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}\\leftarrow|G_{\\boldsymbol{q}}|^{-1}\\sum_{R}(\\pm"
" R)\\boldsymbol{v}` "
"(時間反転のパートナーにはマイナス符号)。ブロック平均はトレースの近似であり、速度がベクトルとして輸送に入る箇所 "
"(反復および直接ボルツマンソルバーと、結果ファイルに書き出される速度) "
"でのみ用いられます。適応スメアリングの幅は平均していない差分を保持します。これは、幅が分枝ごとの "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{j}\\pm\\boldsymbol{v}_{j'}|` から構成され、ブロック内の 2 "
"つの逆向きの傾きは、その平均がゼロであっても非ゼロの幅を与えるためです。したがって 3 "
"フォノン線幅は変わりません。自明な小群をもつメッシュ点では何も行わないため、そこでの偶然縮退はソートされた分枝の対応付けをそのまま保持します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:272
msgid ""
"If one needs to save the group velocities, please turn on the "
"``PRINTVEL``-tag; the printed values follow the same formulation as the "
"conductivity in that run. At a degeneracy they are one admissible basis "
"choice, not a unique value."
msgstr ""
"群速度を保存する必要がある場合は、``PRINTVEL`` "
"タグを有効にしてください。出力される値は、その実行における熱伝導率と同じ定式化に従います。縮退点では、それらは許容される基底の選び方の 1 "
"つであり、一意な値ではありません。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:277
msgid "Mode effective charge"
msgstr "モード有効電荷 (mode effective charge)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:279
msgid "The mode effective charge is defined as"
msgstr "モード有効電荷は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:281
msgid ""
"Z^{*}_{j,\\alpha} = "
"\\sum_{\\kappa\\beta}Z^{*}_{\\kappa,\\alpha\\beta}\\frac{e_{\\beta}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{0}j)}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}}}"
msgstr ""
"Z^{*}_{j,\\alpha} = "
"\\sum_{\\kappa\\beta}Z^{*}_{\\kappa,\\alpha\\beta}\\frac{e_{\\beta}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{0}j)}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}}}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:285
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`Z^{*}_{\\kappa,\\alpha\\beta}` is the atomic Born effective "
"charge. To compute the mode effective charges of the zone-center modes, "
"please set ``ZMODE = 1`` in the &analysis field and supply ``BORNINFO``."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`Z^{*}_{\\kappa,\\alpha\\beta}` は原子の Born "
"有効電荷です。ゾーン中心モードのモード有効電荷を計算するには、&analysis フィールドで ``ZMODE = 1`` "
"を設定し、``BORNINFO`` を与えてください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:289
msgid "Thermodynamic functions"
msgstr "熱力学関数"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:291
msgid ""
"The specific heat at constant volume :math:`C_{\\mathrm{v}}`, the "
"internal energy :math:`U`, the vibrational entropy :math:`S`, and the "
"Helmholtz free energy :math:`F` of independent harmonic oscillators are "
"given as follows:"
msgstr ""
"独立な調和振動子の定積比熱 :math:`C_{\\mathrm{v}}`、内部エネルギー :math:`U`、振動エントロピー "
":math:`S`、およびヘルムホルツ自由エネルギー :math:`F` は次のように与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:295
msgid ""
"\\begin{align*}\n"
" U &= \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j} "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} "
"\\left[\\frac{1}{e^{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT} - 1} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\right], \\\\\n"
" C_{\\mathrm{v}} &= \\frac{k}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j} "
"\\left(\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2kT}\\right)^{2} "
"\\mathrm{cosech}^{2}\\left(\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2kT}\\right),\\\\"
"\n"
" S &= \\frac{k}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j} "
"\\left[\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{kT} "
"\\frac{1}{e^{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT} - 1}\n"
"    - \\log{\\left( 1 - "
"e^{-\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}\\right)}\\right], \\\\\n"
" F &= \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\left[ "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2} + kT\\log{\\left( 1 - "
"e^{-\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}\\right)} \\right].\n"
"\\end{align*}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align*}\n"
" U &= \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j} "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} "
"\\left[\\frac{1}{e^{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT} - 1} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\right], \\\\\n"
" C_{\\mathrm{v}} &= \\frac{k}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j} "
"\\left(\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2kT}\\right)^{2} "
"\\mathrm{cosech}^{2}\\left(\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2kT}\\right),\\\\"
"\n"
" S &= \\frac{k}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j} "
"\\left[\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{kT} "
"\\frac{1}{e^{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT} - 1}\n"
"    - \\log{\\left( 1 - "
"e^{-\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}\\right)}\\right], \\\\\n"
" F &= \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\left[ "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2} + kT\\log{\\left( 1 - "
"e^{-\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}\\right)} \\right].\n"
"\\end{align*}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:306
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`k` is the Boltzmann constant. These quantities are saved in "
"the ``PREFIX``.thermo file."
msgstr "ここで :math:`k` はボルツマン定数です。これらの量は ``PREFIX``.thermo ファイルに保存されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:308
msgid ""
"When the self-consistent phonon mode (``MODE = SCPH``) is selected, the "
"anharmonic free-energy defined by the following equation will be "
"calculated and saved in the ``PREFIX``.scph_thermo file:"
msgstr ""
"自己無撞着フォノン (self-consistent phonon, SCPH) モード (``MODE = SCPH``) "
"が選択された場合、次式で定義される非調和自由エネルギーが計算され、``PREFIX``.scph_thermo ファイルに保存されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:311
msgid ""
"\\begin{align*}\n"
" F^{\\mathrm{SCP}} &= \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\left[ "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2} + kT\\log{\\left( 1 - "
"e^{-\\hbar\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}\\right)} \\right] \\\\\n"
" & - \\frac{1}{4N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\left[ "
"\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2} - "
"(C_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{\\dagger}\\Lambda_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{(\\mathrm{HA})}C_{\\boldsymbol{q}})_{jj}"
" \\right]\n"
" \\times \\frac{\\hbar [1 + 2n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} "
"]}{2\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}.\n"
"\\end{align*}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align*}\n"
" F^{\\mathrm{SCP}} &= \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\left[ "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{2} + kT\\log{\\left( 1 - "
"e^{-\\hbar\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}\\right)} \\right] \\\\\n"
" & - \\frac{1}{4N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\left[ "
"\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2} - "
"(C_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{\\dagger}\\Lambda_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{(\\mathrm{HA})}C_{\\boldsymbol{q}})_{jj}"
" \\right]\n"
" \\times \\frac{\\hbar [1 + 2n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} "
"]}{2\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}.\n"
"\\end{align*}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:320
msgid ""
"Details of the derivation of the above expression can be found in Ref. "
"[Oba2019]_."
msgstr "上記の式の導出の詳細は、文献 [Oba2019]_ に記載されています。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:325
msgid "Bubble correction to the free energy"
msgstr "自由エネルギーのバブル補正"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:327
msgid ""
"When ``FE_BUBBLE = 1``, the lowest-order contribution of the cubic "
"anharmonicity to the free energy, which comes from the bubble diagram "
"with two cubic vertices, is also computed:"
msgstr ""
"``FE_BUBBLE = 1`` のときは、2 つの 3 次の頂点をもつバブルダイアグラムに由来する、3 "
"次の非調和性による自由エネルギーへの最低次の寄与も計算されます:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:330
msgid ""
"F^{\\mathrm{B}} &= -\\frac{1}{6\\hbar "
"N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}}\\sum_{j,j_{1},j_{2}}"
"\n"
"|V^{(3)}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\left[ \\frac{(1+n)(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - n n_{1} n_{2}}{\\omega"
" + \\omega_{1} + \\omega_{2}}\n"
"+ 3\\,\\frac{n(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - (1+n) n_{1} n_{2}}{\\omega_{1} + "
"\\omega_{2} - \\omega} \\right],"
msgstr ""
"F^{\\mathrm{B}} &= -\\frac{1}{6\\hbar "
"N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}}\\sum_{j,j_{1},j_{2}}"
"\n"
"|V^{(3)}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\left[ \\frac{(1+n)(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - n n_{1} n_{2}}{\\omega"
" + \\omega_{1} + \\omega_{2}}\n"
"+ 3\\,\\frac{n(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - (1+n) n_{1} n_{2}}{\\omega_{1} + "
"\\omega_{2} - \\omega} \\right],"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:338
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\omega = \\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`, :math:`\\omega_{i} = "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{i}j_{i}}`, :math:`n = n(\\omega)`, :math:`n_{i}"
" = n(\\omega_{i})`, and :math:`V^{(3)}` is the three-phonon matrix "
"element defined in :ref:`formalism_self_energy`, which vanishes unless "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}` is a "
"reciprocal lattice vector. The numerator of the second term vanishes at "
":math:`\\omega = \\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2}`, so the expression has no pole "
"there. Modes with zero frequency (the acoustic modes at :math:`\\Gamma`) "
"are excluded from the sum. In ``MODE = phonons``, the harmonic "
"frequencies and eigenvectors are used at all temperatures. In ``MODE = "
"SCPH``, the SCPH frequencies :math:`\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` and "
"eigenvectors of each temperature are used instead, both in "
":math:`V^{(3)}` and in the occupation factors, while the cubic force "
"constants are unchanged. The occupation factors expand as "
":math:`(1+n)(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - n n_{1} n_{2} = 1 + n + n_{1} + n_{2} + "
"n n_{1} + n_{1} n_{2} + n_{2} n` and :math:`n(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - (1+n) "
"n_{1} n_{2} = n + n n_{1} + n n_{2} - n_{1} n_{2}`. When ``CLASSICAL = "
"1``, only the terms quadratic in the occupations are kept, with "
":math:`n_{i} = kT/\\hbar\\omega_{i}`, and the bracket becomes "
":math:`4(kT/\\hbar)^{2}/(\\omega\\omega_{1}\\omega_{2})`, so that "
":math:`F^{\\mathrm{B}}` is proportional to :math:`T^{2}` in ``MODE = "
"phonons``. The bubble contributions to :math:`C_{\\mathrm{v}}` and "
":math:`S` are not computed; they can be obtained by numerical temperature"
" derivatives of the free energy."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\omega = \\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`、:math:`\\omega_{i} = "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{i}j_{i}}`、:math:`n = n(\\omega)`、:math:`n_{i} ="
" n(\\omega_{i})` であり、:math:`V^{(3)}` は :ref:`formalism_self_energy` で定義した"
" 3 "
"フォノン行列要素で、:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}`"
" が逆格子ベクトルでない限りゼロになります。第 2 項の分子は :math:`\\omega = \\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2}`"
" でゼロになるため、この式はそこに極をもちません。振動数がゼロのモード (:math:`\\Gamma` 点の音響モード) "
"は和から除かれます。``MODE = phonons`` では、すべての温度で調和振動数と固有ベクトルが用いられます。``MODE = "
"SCPH`` では、代わりに各温度の SCPH 振動数 :math:`\\Omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` と固有ベクトルが "
":math:`V^{(3)}` と占有数因子の両方に用いられ、3 次の力定数はそのまま用いられます。占有数因子は "
":math:`(1+n)(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - n n_{1} n_{2} = 1 + n + n_{1} + n_{2} + "
"n n_{1} + n_{1} n_{2} + n_{2} n` および :math:`n(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - (1+n) "
"n_{1} n_{2} = n + n n_{1} + n n_{2} - n_{1} n_{2}` と展開されます。``CLASSICAL = "
"1`` のときは、:math:`n_{i} = kT/\\hbar\\omega_{i}` として占有数について 2 次の項のみが残され、括弧内は"
" :math:`4(kT/\\hbar)^{2}/(\\omega\\omega_{1}\\omega_{2})` となるので、``MODE = "
"phonons`` では :math:`F^{\\mathrm{B}}` は :math:`T^{2}` "
"に比例します。:math:`C_{\\mathrm{v}}` と :math:`S` "
"へのバブルの寄与は計算されません。必要な場合は、自由エネルギーの温度に関する数値微分から求めることができます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:324
msgid "Mean square displacement"
msgstr "平均二乗変位 (mean square displacement)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:327
msgid "The displacement-displacement correlation function is given by"
msgstr "変位-変位相関関数は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:329
msgid ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
" \\left< u_{\\mu}(0\\kappa)u_{\\nu}(\\ell'\\kappa') \\right> & = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa'}}N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\n"
" \\frac{\\hbar (2n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+1)}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}\n"
" "
"\\mathrm{Re}\\bigg[e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)e_{\\nu}^{*}(\\kappa';\\boldsymbol{q}j)"
" e^{-i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell')}  \\bigg],\n"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
" \\left< u_{\\mu}(0\\kappa)u_{\\nu}(\\ell'\\kappa') \\right> & = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa'}}N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\n"
" \\frac{\\hbar (2n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+1)}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}\n"
" "
"\\mathrm{Re}\\bigg[e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)e_{\\nu}^{*}(\\kappa';\\boldsymbol{q}j)"
" e^{-i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell')}  \\bigg],\n"
"\\end{align}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:338
msgid ""
"where :math:`n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"1/(e^{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}-1)` is the Bose-Einstein "
"distribution function. When ``UCORR = 1``, the code prints the above "
"correlation function in ``PREFIX``.ucorr. The vector "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell')` is the lattice translation vector to the "
":math:`\\ell'` \\ th unit cell, which can be specified by the "
"``SHIFT_UCORR`` tag. When ``PRINTMSD`` is turned on, the code prints the "
"mean square displacements, which are the diagonal components of the "
"correlation function:"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"1/(e^{\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/kT}-1)` "
"はボース・アインシュタイン分布関数です。``UCORR = 1`` のとき、コードは上記の相関関数を ``PREFIX``.ucorr "
"に出力します。ベクトル :math:`\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell')` は :math:`\\ell'` \\ 番目の単位胞 "
"(unit cell) への格子並進ベクトルであり、``SHIFT_UCORR`` タグで指定できます。``PRINTMSD`` "
"が有効な場合、コードは平均二乗変位を出力します。これは相関関数の対角成分です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:341
msgid ""
"\\left< u_{\\mu}^{2}(0\\kappa)\\right> = "
"\\frac{\\hbar}{M_{\\kappa}N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\frac{1}{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}"
" |e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}\n"
"\\left(n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)."
msgstr ""
"\\left< u_{\\mu}^{2}(0\\kappa)\\right> = "
"\\frac{\\hbar}{M_{\\kappa}N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\frac{1}{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}"
" |e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}\n"
"\\left(n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:348
msgid "Phonon DOS"
msgstr "フォノン状態密度 (phonon DOS)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:350
msgid ""
"When *KPMODE* = 2, the program *anphon* saves the (one) phonon density of"
" states (DOS) to the file ``PREFIX``.dos. The one-phonon DOS is given by"
msgstr ""
"*KPMODE* = 2 のとき、プログラム *anphon* は (1) フォノン状態密度 (density of states, DOS) "
"をファイル ``PREFIX``.dos に保存します。1 フォノン DOS は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:353
msgid ""
"\\mathrm{DOS}(\\omega) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\delta(\\omega - "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})."
msgstr ""
"\\mathrm{DOS}(\\omega) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}\\delta(\\omega - "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:357
msgid ""
"If ``PDOS = 1`` is given, the program also prints the atom-projected "
"phonon DOS which is given by"
msgstr "``PDOS = 1`` が指定された場合、プログラムは原子射影フォノン DOS も出力します。これは次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:359
msgid ""
"\\mathrm{PDOS}(\\kappa;\\omega) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}\\delta(\\omega"
" - \\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})."
msgstr ""
"\\mathrm{PDOS}(\\kappa;\\omega) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}\\delta(\\omega"
" - \\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:363
msgid ""
"In addition, ``TDOS``-tag is available to compute the two-phonon DOS "
"defined by"
msgstr "さらに、``TDOS`` タグを用いて、次式で定義される 2 フォノン DOS を計算できます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:365
msgid ""
"\\mathrm{DOS2}(\\omega;\\boldsymbol{q};\\pm) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}, j_{1}, "
"j_{2}}\n"
"\\delta(\\omega\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})\\delta_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}},"
msgstr ""
"\\mathrm{DOS2}(\\omega;\\boldsymbol{q};\\pm) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}, j_{1}, "
"j_{2}}\n"
"\\delta(\\omega\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})\\delta_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:370
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\boldsymbol{G}` is a reciprocal lattice vector. The signs "
":math:`\\pm` correspond to absorption and emission processes, "
"respectively. Please note that the computation of the two-phonon DOS can "
"be expensive especially when :math:`N_{q}` or :math:`N_{\\kappa}` is "
"large."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\boldsymbol{G}` は逆格子ベクトルです。符号 :math:`\\pm` "
"はそれぞれ吸収過程と放出過程に対応します。2 フォノン DOS の計算は、特に :math:`N_{q}` や "
":math:`N_{\\kappa}` が大きい場合に高コストになり得ることに注意してください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:375
msgid "(Atomic) participation ratio"
msgstr "(原子) 関与率 (participation ratio)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:377
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Participation ratio (PR) and atomic participation ratio (APR) defined in "
"the following may be useful to analyze the localized nature of the phonon"
" mode :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j`."
msgstr ""
"以下で定義される関与率 (participation ratio, PR) と原子関与率 (atomic participation ratio,"
" APR) は、フォノンモード :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` の局在性を解析するのに有用です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:379
msgid "Participation ratio (PR)"
msgstr "関与率 (PR)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:381
msgid ""
"PR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = \\left(\\sum_{\\kappa}^{N_{\\kappa}} "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}}{M_{\\kappa}}\\right)^{2}"
" \\Bigg/\n"
"N_{\\kappa} \\sum_{\\kappa}^{N_{\\kappa}} "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{4}}{M_{\\kappa}^{2}}"
msgstr ""
"PR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = \\left(\\sum_{\\kappa}^{N_{\\kappa}} "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}}{M_{\\kappa}}\\right)^{2}"
" \\Bigg/\n"
"N_{\\kappa} \\sum_{\\kappa}^{N_{\\kappa}} "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{4}}{M_{\\kappa}^{2}}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:386
msgid "Atomic participation ratio (APR)"
msgstr "原子関与率 (APR)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:388
msgid ""
"APR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\kappa} = "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}}{M_{\\kappa}} "
"\\Bigg/ \\left(  N_{\\kappa} \\sum_{\\kappa}^{N_{\\kappa}} "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{4}}{M_{\\kappa}^{2}} "
"\\right)^{1/2}"
msgstr ""
"APR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\kappa} = "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2}}{M_{\\kappa}} "
"\\Bigg/ \\left(  N_{\\kappa} \\sum_{\\kappa}^{N_{\\kappa}} "
"\\frac{|\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{4}}{M_{\\kappa}^{2}} "
"\\right)^{1/2}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:392
msgid ""
"For an extended eigenmode, the PR value is of order 1, whereas for a "
"localized eigenmodes PR is of order :math:`1/N_{\\kappa}` [Hafner1993]_. "
"APR is an atomic decomposition of PR that satisfies "
":math:`PR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = \\sum_{\\kappa} "
"(APR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\kappa})^{2}`. To print the PR and APR, please "
"set ``MODE = phonons`` and ``PRINTPR = 1`` in the ``&analysis`` entry "
"field."
msgstr ""
"拡がった固有モードでは PR 値は 1 のオーダーですが、局在した固有モードでは PR は :math:`1/N_{\\kappa}` "
"のオーダーになります [Hafner1993]_。APR は :math:`PR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"\\sum_{\\kappa} (APR_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\kappa})^{2}` を満たす PR の原子分解です。PR "
"と APR を出力するには、``&analysis`` エントリフィールドで ``MODE = phonons`` および ``PRINTPR ="
" 1`` を設定してください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:395
msgid "Scattering phase space"
msgstr "散乱位相空間 (scattering phase space)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:397
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When *KPMODE* = 2 and ``SPS = 1``, the three-phonon scattering phase "
"space :math:`P_{3}` is calculated and saved to the file ``PREFIX``.sps. "
":math:`P_{3}` is defined as"
msgstr ""
"*KPMODE* = 2 かつ ``SPS = 1`` のとき、3 フォノン散乱位相空間 :math:`P_{3}` が計算され、ファイル "
"``PREFIX``.sps に保存されます。:math:`P_{3}` は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:399
msgid ""
"P_{3}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) = \\frac{1}{3m^{3}} "
"(2P_{3}^{(+)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) + P_{3}^{(-)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j)),"
msgstr ""
"P_{3}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) = \\frac{1}{3m^{3}} "
"(2P_{3}^{(+)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) + P_{3}^{(-)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j)),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:403
msgid "where :math:`m` is the number of phonon branches and"
msgstr "ここで :math:`m` はフォノンの分枝の数で、"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:405
msgid ""
"P_{3}^{(\\pm)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}, j_{1}, "
"j_{2}}\\delta(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})\\delta_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}}."
msgstr ""
"P_{3}^{(\\pm)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}, j_{1}, "
"j_{2}}\\delta(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})\\delta_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:409
msgid "*anphon* also prints the total scattering phase space"
msgstr "*anphon* は次の全散乱位相空間も出力します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:411
msgid "P_{3} = \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} P_{3}(\\boldsymbol{q}j)."
msgstr "P_{3} = \\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} P_{3}(\\boldsymbol{q}j)."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:415
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When ``SPS = 2``, the three-phonon scattering phase space with the "
"occupation factor :math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` will be calculated and saved to "
"the file ``PREFIX``.sps_Bose. :math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` is defined as"
msgstr ""
"``SPS = 2`` のとき、占有因子 :math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` を含む 3 フォノン散乱位相空間が計算され、ファイル "
"``PREFIX``.sps_Bose に保存されます。:math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:417
msgid ""
"W_{3}^{(\\pm)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}{\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}, j_{1}, "
"j_{2}}}\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"  \\begin{array}{c}\n"
"  n_{2} - n_{1} \\\\\n"
"  n_{1} + n_{2} + 1\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"\\delta(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})\\delta_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}}."
msgstr ""
"W_{3}^{(\\pm)}(\\boldsymbol{q}j) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}{\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}, j_{1}, "
"j_{2}}}\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"  \\begin{array}{c}\n"
"  n_{2} - n_{1} \\\\\n"
"  n_{1} + n_{2} + 1\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"\\delta(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})\\delta_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\pm\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:428
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`n_{1}=n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}})` and "
":math:`n_{2}=n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})` where "
":math:`n(\\omega) = \\frac{1}{e^{\\hbar\\omega/k_B T}-1}` is the Bose-"
"Einstein distribution function. Since :math:`n(\\omega)` is temperature "
"dependent, :math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` is also temperature dependent. The file"
" ``PREFIX``.sps_Bose contains :math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` for all phonon modes"
" at various temperatures specified with ``TMIN``, ``TMAX``, and ``DT`` "
"tags."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`n_{1}=n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}})` および "
":math:`n_{2}=n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}})` であり、:math:`n(\\omega)"
" = \\frac{1}{e^{\\hbar\\omega/k_B T}-1}` "
"はボース・アインシュタイン分布関数です。:math:`n(\\omega)` は温度依存性をもつため、:math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}`"
" も温度依存性をもちます。ファイル ``PREFIX``.sps_Bose には、``TMIN``、``TMAX``、``DT`` "
"タグで指定された種々の温度におけるすべてのフォノンモードの :math:`W_{3}^{(\\pm)}` が含まれます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:433
msgid "Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen parameter"
msgstr "Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen パラメータ"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:435
msgid ""
"The volumetric mode Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen parameter, defined as "
":math:`\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = - \\frac{\\partial "
"\\log{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}}{\\partial \\log{V}}`, is calculated by"
msgstr ""
"体積モード Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen パラメータは :math:`\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} "
"= - \\frac{\\partial \\log{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}}{\\partial "
"\\log{V}}` で定義され、次式で計算されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:438
msgid ""
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}= "
"-\\frac{(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}} \\delta "
"D(\\boldsymbol{q})\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{6\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}},"
msgstr ""
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}= "
"-\\frac{(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}} \\delta "
"D(\\boldsymbol{q})\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{6\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:442
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\delta D(\\boldsymbol{q})` is a change in the dynamical "
"matrix due to a volume change :math:`\\delta V`, which is given by"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\delta D(\\boldsymbol{q})` は体積変化 :math:`\\delta V` "
"による動力学行列の変化であり、次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:445
msgid ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
" \\delta D_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) &= "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
" "
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\delta\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))\\right]},\\\\"
"\n"
" \\delta\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})\n"
" &= "
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime\\prime},\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime},\\lambda}\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime};\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})r_{\\lambda}(\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})."
"\n"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
" \\delta D_{\\mu\\nu}(\\kappa\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}) &= "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}}}\n"
" "
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime}}\\delta\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})\\exp{\\left[i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))\\right]},\\\\"
"\n"
" \\delta\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})\n"
" &= "
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime\\prime},\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime},\\lambda}\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime};\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})r_{\\lambda}(\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})."
"\n"
"\\end{align}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:455
msgid ""
"Please set ``GRUNEISEN = 1`` and give an appropriate ``FCSFILE`` file "
"containing cubic IFCs to print the volumetric Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"体積 Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen パラメータを出力するには、``GRUNEISEN = 1`` を設定し、3 "
"次の原子間力定数 (IFCs) を含む適切な ``FCSFILE`` ファイルを与えてください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:457
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The **generalized** Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen parameters resolve the "
"frequency change with respect to each component of the symmetric strain "
"tensor :math:`\\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}`:"
msgstr ""
"**一般化** Gr\\ |umulaut_u|\\ neisen パラメータは、対称ひずみテンソル "
":math:`\\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}` の各成分に対する振動数の変化を分解したものです。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:459
msgid ""
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} = - \\frac{\\partial "
"\\log{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}}{\\partial \\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"= -\\frac{1}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}} "
"(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}} \\frac{\\partial "
"D(\\boldsymbol{q})}{\\partial "
"\\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}}\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j},"
msgstr ""
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} = - \\frac{\\partial "
"\\log{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}}{\\partial \\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"= -\\frac{1}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}} "
"(\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{*})^{\\mathrm{T}} \\frac{\\partial "
"D(\\boldsymbol{q})}{\\partial "
"\\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}}\\boldsymbol{e}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:464
msgid ""
"where the strain derivative of the harmonic IFCs is obtained from the "
"cubic IFCs as"
msgstr "ここで、調和 IFC のひずみ微分は 3 次 IFC から次のように得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:466
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial "
"\\Phi_{\\alpha\\beta}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})}{\\partial"
" \\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"= "
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime\\prime},\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}}\\Phi_{\\alpha\\beta\\mu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime};\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})r_{\\nu}(\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}),"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{\\partial "
"\\Phi_{\\alpha\\beta}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime})}{\\partial"
" \\varepsilon_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"= "
"\\sum_{\\ell^{\\prime\\prime},\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}}\\Phi_{\\alpha\\beta\\mu}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime};\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})r_{\\nu}(\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:471
msgid ""
"and the off-diagonal components are symmetrized as "
":math:`(\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} + "
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu\\mu})/2`. The volumetric parameter is "
"recovered as one third of the trace, :math:`\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"(\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{xx} + \\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{yy} + "
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{zz})/3`. The generalized parameters are "
"useful for studying anisotropic thermal expansion and thermal stress "
"within the quasi-harmonic approximation. Please set ``GRUNEISEN = 2`` "
"(diagonal components) or ``GRUNEISEN = 3`` (all 6 components in the Voigt"
" order xx, yy, zz, yz, xz, xy) to print them."
msgstr ""
"また、非対角成分は :math:`(\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} + "
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu\\mu})/2` のように対称化されます。体積パラメータはトレースの 3 分の "
"1、:math:`\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = (\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{xx} + "
"\\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{yy} + \\gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{zz})/3` "
"として復元されます。一般化パラメータは、準調和近似の枠組みで異方的な熱膨張や熱応力を調べるのに有用です。出力するには ``GRUNEISEN = "
"2`` (対角成分) または ``GRUNEISEN = 3`` (Voigt 順 xx, yy, zz, yz, xz, xy の全 6 成分)"
" を設定してください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:479
msgid "Anharmonic self-energy"
msgstr "非調和自己エネルギー (anharmonic self-energy)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:481
msgid ""
"The anharmonic self-energy due to cubic anharmonicity to the lowest order"
" is given by"
msgstr "3 次の非調和性による非調和自己エネルギーは、最低次で次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:483
msgid ""
"\\Sigma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(i\\omega_m) &= "
"\\frac{1}{2\\hbar^{2}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}}\\sum_{j_{1},j_{2}}"
"\n"
"|V^{(3)}_{-\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\left[ \\frac{n_{1}+n_{2} + 1}{i\\omega_{m} + \\omega_{1} + "
"\\omega_{2}} - \\frac{n_{1}+n_{2} + 1}{i\\omega_{m} - \\omega_{1} - "
"\\omega_{2}}\n"
"+ \\frac{n_{1}-n_{2}}{i\\omega_{m} - \\omega_{1} + \\omega_{2}} - "
"\\frac{n_{1}-n_{2}}{i\\omega_{m} + \\omega_{1} - \\omega_{2}} \\right],"
msgstr ""
"\\Sigma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(i\\omega_m) &= "
"\\frac{1}{2\\hbar^{2}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}}\\sum_{j_{1},j_{2}}"
"\n"
"|V^{(3)}_{-\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\left[ \\frac{n_{1}+n_{2} + 1}{i\\omega_{m} + \\omega_{1} + "
"\\omega_{2}} - \\frac{n_{1}+n_{2} + 1}{i\\omega_{m} - \\omega_{1} - "
"\\omega_{2}}\n"
"+ \\frac{n_{1}-n_{2}}{i\\omega_{m} - \\omega_{1} + \\omega_{2}} - "
"\\frac{n_{1}-n_{2}}{i\\omega_{m} + \\omega_{1} - \\omega_{2}} \\right],"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:491
msgid ""
"where :math:`i\\omega_{m}` is the Matsubara frequency. In equation "
":eq:`self3`, we simply denoted :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{i}j_{i}}`"
" as :math:`\\omega_{i}`. The matrix element :math:`V^{(3)}` is given by"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`i\\omega_{m}` は松原振動数 (Matsubara frequency) です。式 :eq:`self3` "
"では、:math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{i}j_{i}}` を単に :math:`\\omega_{i}` "
"と表記しました。行列要素 :math:`V^{(3)}` は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:493
msgid ""
"V^{(3)}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime},\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime}}"
"\n"
"& = \\left( \\frac{\\hbar}{2N_{q}}\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime}}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime}}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell,\\ell^{\\prime},\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left[\\mathrm{i}(\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}))\\right]}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\sum_{\\kappa,\\kappa^{\\prime},\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}} "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda}\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime};\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})"
"\n"
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)e_{\\nu}(\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime})e_{\\lambda}(\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime})"
" \\; ,"
msgstr ""
"V^{(3)}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime},\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime}}"
"\n"
"& = \\left( \\frac{\\hbar}{2N_{q}}\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime}}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime}}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell,\\ell^{\\prime},\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left[\\mathrm{i}(\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime})+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}))\\right]}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\sum_{\\kappa,\\kappa^{\\prime},\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}} "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime}}M_{\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime}}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda}\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell^{\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime};\\ell^{\\prime\\prime}\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime})"
"\n"
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)e_{\\nu}(\\kappa^{\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime})e_{\\lambda}(\\kappa^{\\prime\\prime};\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime})"
" \\; ,"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:506
msgid ""
"which becomes zero unless "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}`"
" is an integral multiple of "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{G}=n_{1}\\boldsymbol{b}_{1}+n_{2}\\boldsymbol{b}_{2}+n_{3}\\boldsymbol{b}_{3}`."
" Phonon linewidth :math:`\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`, which is the "
"imaginary part of the phonon self-energy, can be obtained by the analytic"
" continuation to the real axis (:math:`i\\omega_{m}\\to \\omega + "
"i0^{+}`) as"
msgstr ""
"これは、:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}+\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}`"
" が "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{G}=n_{1}\\boldsymbol{b}_{1}+n_{2}\\boldsymbol{b}_{2}+n_{3}\\boldsymbol{b}_{3}`"
" の整数倍でない限りゼロになります。フォノン線幅 :math:`\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` "
"は、フォノン自己エネルギーの虚部であり、実軸への解析接続 (:math:`i\\omega_{m}\\to \\omega + i0^{+}`) "
"によって次のように得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:509
msgid ""
" \\Gamma^{\\mathrm{3rd}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(\\omega) &= "
"\\frac{\\pi}{2\\hbar^{2}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}}\\sum_{j_{1},j_{2}}"
"\n"
" "
"|V^{(3)}_{-\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\times \\left[ -(n_{1}+n_{2} + 1)\\delta{(\\omega + \\omega_{1} + "
"\\omega_{2})} + (n_{1}+n_{2} + 1) \\delta{(\\omega - \\omega_{1} - "
"\\omega_{2})} \\right. \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\left. \\hspace{12mm} - (n_{1}-n_{2})\\delta{(\\omega - \\omega_{1} +"
" \\omega_{2})} + (n_{1}-n_{2})\\delta{(\\omega + \\omega_{1} - "
"\\omega_{2})} \\right]."
msgstr ""
" \\Gamma^{\\mathrm{3rd}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(\\omega) &= "
"\\frac{\\pi}{2\\hbar^{2}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}}\\sum_{j_{1},j_{2}}"
"\n"
" "
"|V^{(3)}_{-\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\times \\left[ -(n_{1}+n_{2} + 1)\\delta{(\\omega + \\omega_{1} + "
"\\omega_{2})} + (n_{1}+n_{2} + 1) \\delta{(\\omega - \\omega_{1} - "
"\\omega_{2})} \\right. \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\left. \\hspace{12mm} - (n_{1}-n_{2})\\delta{(\\omega - \\omega_{1} +"
" \\omega_{2})} + (n_{1}-n_{2})\\delta{(\\omega + \\omega_{1} - "
"\\omega_{2})} \\right]."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:517
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computation of equation :eq:`selfmod` is the most expensive part of "
"the thermal conductivity calculations. Therefore, we employ the crystal "
"symmetry to reduce the number of triplet pairs "
":math:`(\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime},\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime})`"
" of :math:`V^{(3)}` to calculate. The tetrahedron integration weights "
"(``ISMEAR = -1``) are not invariant under the point group; they are "
"therefore averaged over each group of symmetry-equivalent triplets, and "
"the reduced calculation agrees closely with the unreduced one. The same "
"reduction is used for the collision operator of the iterative BTE "
"solvers. To disable the reduction, please set ``TRISYM = 0``."
msgstr ""
"式 :eq:`selfmod` の計算は、熱伝導率 (thermal conductivity) "
"計算の中で最もコストのかかる部分です。そのため、計算する :math:`V^{(3)}` の三つ組 "
":math:`(\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime}j^{\\prime},\\boldsymbol{q}^{\\prime\\prime}j^{\\prime\\prime})`"
" の数を減らすために結晶対称性を利用します。四面体法の積分重み (``ISMEAR = -1``) "
"は点群のもとで不変ではないため、対称的に等価な三つ組の各グループにわたって平均され、削減した計算は削減しない計算とよく一致します。反復 BTE "
"ソルバーの衝突演算子にも同じ削減が用いられます。この削減を無効にするには、``TRISYM = 0`` を設定してください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:527
msgid "Four-phonon scattering"
msgstr "4 フォノン散乱"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:529
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When ``INCLUDE_4PH = 1`` in the ``&kappa`` field, the scattering rates "
"due to the quartic anharmonicity are added to those of equation "
":eq:`selfmod` [Feng2016]_. They come from the imaginary part of the "
"lowest-order self-energy diagram with two quartic vertices (the "
"\"sunset\" diagram), whose matrix element is defined in the same way as "
":math:`V^{(3)}`:"
msgstr ""
"``&kappa`` フィールドで ``INCLUDE_4PH = 1`` とすると、4 次の非調和性による散乱レートが式 "
":eq:`selfmod` のレートに加えられます [Feng2016]_。これは 4 次のバーテックスを 2 つ含む最低次の自己エネルギー図形 "
"(\"sunset\" 図形) の虚部から得られ、その行列要素は :math:`V^{(3)}` と同様に次のように定義されます:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:534
msgid ""
"V^{(4)}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}j_{3}}"
"\n"
"& = \\left( \\frac{\\hbar}{2N_{q}}\\right)^{2}\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{1}\\omega_{2}\\omega_{3}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell,\\ell_{1},\\ell_{2},\\ell_{3}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left[\\mathrm{i}(\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)+\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell_{1})+\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell_{2})+\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell_{3}))\\right]}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\sum_{\\kappa,\\kappa_{1},\\kappa_{2},\\kappa_{3}} "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa_{1}}M_{\\kappa_{2}}M_{\\kappa_{3}}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda,\\rho}\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda\\rho}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell_{1}\\kappa_{1};\\ell_{2}\\kappa_{2};\\ell_{3}\\kappa_{3})"
"\n"
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)e_{\\nu}(\\kappa_{1};\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1})e_{\\lambda}(\\kappa_{2};\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2})e_{\\rho}(\\kappa_{3};\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}j_{3}),"
msgstr ""
"V^{(4)}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}j_{3}}"
"\n"
"& = \\left( \\frac{\\hbar}{2N_{q}}\\right)^{2}\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{1}\\omega_{2}\\omega_{3}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\ell,\\ell_{1},\\ell_{2},\\ell_{3}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left[\\mathrm{i}(\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)+\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell_{1})+\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell_{2})+\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell_{3}))\\right]}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
"& \\times \\sum_{\\kappa,\\kappa_{1},\\kappa_{2},\\kappa_{3}} "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa_{1}}M_{\\kappa_{2}}M_{\\kappa_{3}}}}"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda,\\rho}\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda\\rho}(\\ell\\kappa;\\ell_{1}\\kappa_{1};\\ell_{2}\\kappa_{2};\\ell_{3}\\kappa_{3})"
"\n"
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)e_{\\nu}(\\kappa_{1};\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1})e_{\\lambda}(\\kappa_{2};\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2})e_{\\rho}(\\kappa_{3};\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}j_{3}),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:546
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"which vanishes unless "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}`"
" is a reciprocal lattice vector. The four-phonon linewidth is then"
msgstr ""
"これは "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}`"
" が逆格子ベクトルでない限りゼロになります。4 フォノン散乱による線幅は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:549
msgid ""
" \\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(\\omega) &= "
"\\frac{\\pi}{6\\hbar^{2}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}}\\sum_{j_{1},j_{2},j_{3}}"
"\n"
" "
"|V^{(4)}_{-\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}j_{3}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\times \\Big\\{ \\left[(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - "
"n_{1}n_{2}n_{3}\\right]\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3})"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\hspace{5mm} + \\left[n_{1}(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - "
"(1+n_{1})n_{2}n_{3}\\right]\\left[\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3})"
" - \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2}+\\omega_{3})\\right] \\notag "
"\\\\\n"
" & \\hspace{5mm} + \\left[n_{2}(1+n_{3})(1+n_{1}) - "
"(1+n_{2})n_{3}n_{1}\\right]\\left[\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3}-\\omega_{1})"
" - \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{2}+\\omega_{3}+\\omega_{1})\\right] \\notag "
"\\\\\n"
" & \\hspace{5mm} + \\left[n_{3}(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - "
"(1+n_{3})n_{1}n_{2}\\right]\\left[\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{3}-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})"
" - \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{3}+\\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2})\\right] \\Big\\},"
msgstr ""
" \\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(\\omega) &= "
"\\frac{\\pi}{6\\hbar^{2}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}}\\sum_{j_{1},j_{2},j_{3}}"
"\n"
" "
"|V^{(4)}_{-\\boldsymbol{q}j,\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}j_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}j_{3}}|^{2}"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\times \\Big\\{ \\left[(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - "
"n_{1}n_{2}n_{3}\\right]\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3})"
" \\notag \\\\\n"
" & \\hspace{5mm} + \\left[n_{1}(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - "
"(1+n_{1})n_{2}n_{3}\\right]\\left[\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3})"
" - \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2}+\\omega_{3})\\right] \\notag "
"\\\\\n"
" & \\hspace{5mm} + \\left[n_{2}(1+n_{3})(1+n_{1}) - "
"(1+n_{2})n_{3}n_{1}\\right]\\left[\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3}-\\omega_{1})"
" - \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{2}+\\omega_{3}+\\omega_{1})\\right] \\notag "
"\\\\\n"
" & \\hspace{5mm} + \\left[n_{3}(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2}) - "
"(1+n_{3})n_{1}n_{2}\\right]\\left[\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{3}-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})"
" - \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{3}+\\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2})\\right] \\Big\\},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:559
msgid ""
"where :math:`n_{i} = n(\\omega_{i})`. The first line describes the "
"splitting of the phonon :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` into three phonons "
"(:math:`1\\to 3`). In each of the remaining three lines, the first delta "
"function describes the processes in which the phonon "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` and one phonon of the quartet are annihilated "
"and the other two are created (:math:`2\\leftrightarrow 2`), and the "
"second one the processes in which the phonon :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` and"
" two phonons of the quartet merge into the third one (:math:`3\\to 1`). "
"The occupation factors expand as :math:`(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - "
"n_{1}n_{2}n_{3} = 1+n_{1}+n_{2}+n_{3}+n_{1}n_{2}+n_{2}n_{3}+n_{3}n_{1}` "
"and :math:`n_{1}(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - (1+n_{1})n_{2}n_{3} = "
"n_{1}+n_{1}n_{2}+n_{1}n_{3}-n_{2}n_{3}`; the leading 1 is dropped when "
"``CLASSICAL = 1``. The partner term "
":math:`-\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2}+\\omega_{3})` of the "
"first line, which makes :math:`\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}(\\omega)` odd in "
":math:`\\omega`, never contributes for :math:`\\omega > 0` and is "
"omitted. In the thermal conductivity calculation, "
":math:`\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})` "
"is added to the out-scattering rate only (see :ref:`below "
"<kappa_peierls>`)."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`n_{i} = n(\\omega_{i})` です。1 行目はフォノン :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` "
"が 3 つのフォノンに分裂する過程 (:math:`1\\to 3`) を表します。残りの 3 行では、1 つ目のデルタ関数がフォノン "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` と四重項の 1 つのフォノンが消滅して残りの 2 つが生成される過程 "
"(:math:`2\\leftrightarrow 2`) を、2 つ目のデルタ関数がフォノン :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` "
"と四重項の 2 つのフォノンが融合して残りの 1 つになる過程 (:math:`3\\to 1`) を表します。占有数因子は "
":math:`(1+n_{1})(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - n_{1}n_{2}n_{3} = "
"1+n_{1}+n_{2}+n_{3}+n_{1}n_{2}+n_{2}n_{3}+n_{3}n_{1}` および "
":math:`n_{1}(1+n_{2})(1+n_{3}) - (1+n_{1})n_{2}n_{3} = "
"n_{1}+n_{1}n_{2}+n_{1}n_{3}-n_{2}n_{3}` と展開でき、``CLASSICAL = 1`` のときは先頭の 1"
" が除かれます。1 行目の相方の項 "
":math:`-\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{1}+\\omega_{2}+\\omega_{3})` は "
":math:`\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}(\\omega)` を :math:`\\omega` "
"の奇関数にするものですが、:math:`\\omega > 0` "
"では寄与しないため省略しています。熱伝導率の計算では、:math:`\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}"
" = "
"\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{4ph}}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})` "
"が流出散乱レートにのみ加えられます (:ref:`後述 <kappa_peierls>`)。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:571
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Because the number of quartets grows as :math:`N_{q}^{2}` per mode "
"instead of :math:`N_{q}` for the triplets, equation :eq:`gamma4ph` is "
"usually evaluated on a :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` mesh coarser than that of "
"the three-phonon part (``KMESH_COARSE``), and the resulting linewidths "
"are interpolated onto the dense mesh by the method selected with "
"``INTERPOLATOR``. The delta functions are evaluated with the Gaussian, "
"Lorentzian, or adaptive smearing chosen with ``ISMEAR_4PH`` and "
"``EPSILON_4PH`` (see :ref:`formalism_delta_function`); the tetrahedron "
"method is not available. For each quartet the band triples "
":math:`(j_{1},j_{2},j_{3})` outside the smearing window are discarded "
"first, and the matrix elements of the remaining ones are obtained by "
"successive contractions of the Fourier-transformed quartic force "
"constants with the eigenvectors (see :ref:`INCLUDE_4PH "
"<anphon_include_4ph>`). Quartets equivalent under the little group of "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` or under the permutations of "
":math:`(\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3})` are"
" evaluated only once. The four-phonon linewidths are written to "
"``PREFIX.kappa.h5`` (``/scattering/4ph/gamma``)."
msgstr ""
"四重項の数はモードあたり :math:`N_{q}^{2}` に比例して増え (三重項では :math:`N_{q}`)、そのため式 "
":eq:`gamma4ph` は通常、3 フォノン部分より粗い :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` メッシュ "
"(``KMESH_COARSE``) で評価され、得られた線幅は ``INTERPOLATOR`` "
"で選んだ方法で密なメッシュに補間されます。デルタ関数は ``ISMEAR_4PH`` と ``EPSILON_4PH`` "
"で選ぶガウス、ローレンツ、または適応スメアリングで評価されます (:ref:`formalism_delta_function` "
"を参照)。四面体法は利用できません。各四重項について、まずスメアリングの窓の外にあるバンドの三つ組 "
":math:`(j_{1},j_{2},j_{3})` を除き、残りの行列要素を、フーリエ変換した 4 "
"次の力定数に固有ベクトルを順に縮約して求めます (:ref:`INCLUDE_4PH <anphon_include_4ph>` "
"を参照)。:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` の小群、あるいは "
":math:`(\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},\\boldsymbol{q}_{2},\\boldsymbol{q}_{3})` "
"の置換で等価な四重項は 1 度だけ評価されます。4 フォノン散乱の線幅は ``PREFIX.kappa.h5`` "
"(``/scattering/4ph/gamma``) に書き出されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:584
msgid "Isotope scattering"
msgstr "同位体散乱 (isotope scattering)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:586
msgid ""
"The effect of isotope scatterings can be considered by the mass "
"perturbation approach proposed by S. Tamura [Tamura1983]_ by the "
"``ISOTOPE``-tag. The corresponding phonon linewidth is given by"
msgstr ""
"同位体散乱の効果は、S. Tamura によって提案された質量摂動アプローチ [Tamura1983]_ を用いて、``ISOTOPE`` "
"タグによって考慮できます。対応するフォノン線幅は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:589
msgid ""
"\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{iso}}(\\omega)= \\frac{\\pi}{4N_{q}}"
" "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},j_{1}}\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}})"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\kappa}g_{2}(\\kappa)|\\boldsymbol{e}^{*}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1})\\cdot\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2},"
msgstr ""
"\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{iso}}(\\omega)= \\frac{\\pi}{4N_{q}}"
" "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{2}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},j_{1}}\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1}})"
"\n"
"\\sum_{\\kappa}g_{2}(\\kappa)|\\boldsymbol{e}^{*}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}j_{1})\\cdot\\boldsymbol{e}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)|^{2},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:594
#, python-brace-format
msgid "where :math:`g_{2}` is a dimensionless factor given by"
msgstr "ここで :math:`g_{2}` は次式で与えられる無次元の因子です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:596
msgid ""
"g_{2}(\\kappa)=\\sum_{i}f_{i}(\\kappa)\\left(1 - "
"\\frac{m_{i}(\\kappa)}{M_{\\kappa}}\\right)^{2}."
msgstr ""
"g_{2}(\\kappa)=\\sum_{i}f_{i}(\\kappa)\\left(1 - "
"\\frac{m_{i}(\\kappa)}{M_{\\kappa}}\\right)^{2}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:600
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`f_{i}` is the fraction of the :math:`i`\\ th isotope of an "
"element having mass :math:`m_i`, and "
":math:`M_{\\kappa}=\\sum_{i}f_{i}m_{i}(\\kappa)` is the average mass, "
"respectively. The :math:`g_{2}` values should be provided by the "
"``ISOFACT``-tag. The average mass :math:`M_{\\kappa}` is substituted by "
"the value specified in the ``MASS``-tag."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`f_{i}` は質量 :math:`m_i` をもつ元素の :math:`i`\\ "
"番目の同位体の存在比であり、:math:`M_{\\kappa}=\\sum_{i}f_{i}m_{i}(\\kappa)` "
"は平均質量です。:math:`g_{2}` の値は ``ISOFACT`` タグで与える必要があります。平均質量 "
":math:`M_{\\kappa}` は ``MASS`` タグで指定された値で置き換えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:608
msgid "Lattice thermal conductivity"
msgstr "格子熱伝導率 (lattice thermal conductivity)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:610
msgid ""
"The lattice thermal conductivity computed by *anphon* is the sum of a "
"particle-like (Peierls) term, in which heat is carried by the populations"
" of the individual phonon modes, and, when requested, a wave-like "
"(coherent) term arising from the interband elements of the heat-flux "
"operator [Simoncelli2022]_. The Peierls term can be evaluated at several "
"levels of approximation to the phonon Boltzmann transport equation, "
"selected by the ``SOLVER`` tag of the ``&kappa`` field."
msgstr ""
"*anphon* が計算する格子熱伝導率は、各フォノンモードの占有数が熱を運ぶ粒子的 (Peierls) "
"項と、要求された場合には熱流演算子のバンド間要素に由来する波動的 (コヒーレント) 項 [Simoncelli2022]_ "
"の和です。Peierls 項は、``&kappa`` フィールドの ``SOLVER`` "
"タグで選択される、フォノンボルツマン輸送方程式に対するいくつかの近似レベルで評価できます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:618
msgid "Peierls term"
msgstr "Peierls 項"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:620
msgid ""
"Under a small temperature gradient the steady-state phonon distribution "
"is written as"
msgstr "小さな温度勾配のもとで、定常状態のフォノン分布は次のように書かれます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:622
msgid ""
"n_{\\lambda} = n^{0}_{\\lambda} - \\frac{\\partial "
"n^{0}_{\\lambda}}{\\partial T}\\,\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda}\\cdot\\nabla "
"T,"
msgstr ""
"n_{\\lambda} = n^{0}_{\\lambda} - \\frac{\\partial "
"n^{0}_{\\lambda}}{\\partial T}\\,\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda}\\cdot\\nabla "
"T,"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:626
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\lambda=\\boldsymbol{q}j`, :math:`n^{0}` is the Bose--"
"Einstein distribution and :math:`\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda}` is the "
"*deviation function*, a vector with the dimension of length (the mean "
"free displacement of mode :math:`\\lambda`). Linearizing the collision "
"term of the Boltzmann transport equation (BTE) [Omini1996]_ "
"[Fugallo2013]_ [Chaput2013]_ turns it into a linear system for "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}`:"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\lambda=\\boldsymbol{q}j`、:math:`n^{0}` は Bose--Einstein "
"分布、:math:`\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda}` は *偏差関数* (deviation function) "
"で、長さの次元をもつベクトル (モード :math:`\\lambda` の平均自由変位) です。ボルツマン輸送方程式 (BTE) "
"[Omini1996]_ [Fugallo2013]_ [Chaput2013]_ "
"の衝突項を線形化すると、:math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` に対する線形方程式系が得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:630
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\sum_{\\lambda'}\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda'}\\,\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda'}"
" = \\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda}."
msgstr ""
"\\sum_{\\lambda'}\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda'}\\,\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda'}"
" = \\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:635
msgid ""
"The collision operator :math:`\\Omega` has the dimension of a scattering "
"rate. Its diagonal is the out-scattering rate "
":math:`\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda}=\\tau_{\\lambda}^{-1}`, and its off-"
"diagonal elements :math:`\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda'}` "
"(:math:`\\lambda\\neq\\lambda'`) are the in-scattering terms, built from "
"the same three-phonon matrix elements :math:`|V^{(3)}|^{2}` and energy-"
"conserving :math:`\\delta` functions as :math:`\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{3rd}}` "
"in equation :eq:`selfmod`. Once :math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` is known, the "
"Peierls term of the thermal conductivity is"
msgstr ""
"衝突演算子 :math:`\\Omega` は散乱レートの次元をもちます。その対角成分は流出散乱 (out-scattering) レート "
":math:`\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda}=\\tau_{\\lambda}^{-1}` であり、非対角成分 "
":math:`\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda'}` (:math:`\\lambda\\neq\\lambda'`) "
"は流入散乱 (in-scattering) 項で、式 :eq:`selfmod` の "
":math:`\\Gamma^{\\mathrm{3rd}}` と同じ 3 フォノン行列要素 :math:`|V^{(3)}|^{2}` "
"およびエネルギー保存の :math:`\\delta` 関数から構成されます。:math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` "
"が求まれば、熱伝導率の Peierls 項は"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:641
msgid ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\nu}(T) = \\frac{1}{VN_{q}}\\sum_{\\lambda} "
"c_{\\lambda}\\,v^{\\mu}_{\\lambda}F^{\\nu}_{\\lambda},"
msgstr ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\nu}(T) = \\frac{1}{VN_{q}}\\sum_{\\lambda} "
"c_{\\lambda}\\,v^{\\mu}_{\\lambda}F^{\\nu}_{\\lambda},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:646
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`V` is the unit cell volume and :math:`c_{\\lambda} = "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\lambda}\\partial n^{0}_{\\lambda}/\\partial T`. Isotope "
"scattering enters :math:`\\Omega` with its own in-scattering term when "
"``ISOTOPE_INSCATTERING = 1`` (default); boundary scattering "
"(``LEN_BOUNDARY``) and :ref:`four-phonon scattering <formalism_4ph>` "
"(``INCLUDE_4PH = 1``) are added to the diagonal only. The four solvers "
"below differ in how equation :eq:`lbte` is solved."
msgstr ""
"となります。ここで :math:`V` は単位胞の体積、:math:`c_{\\lambda} = "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\lambda}\\partial n^{0}_{\\lambda}/\\partial T` です。同位体散乱は"
" ``ISOTOPE_INSCATTERING = 1`` (既定) のとき、固有の流入散乱項を伴って :math:`\\Omega` "
"に含まれます。境界散乱 (``LEN_BOUNDARY``) と :ref:`4 フォノン散乱 <formalism_4ph>` "
"(``INCLUDE_4PH = 1``) は対角成分にのみ加えられます。以下の 4 つのソルバーは、式 :eq:`lbte` "
"の解き方が異なります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:652
msgid "Relaxation-time approximation (``SOLVER = RTA``)"
msgstr "緩和時間近似 (``SOLVER = RTA``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:655
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Dropping the in-scattering part of :math:`\\Omega` gives "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda}=\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda}\\tau_{\\lambda}`,"
" and equation :eq:`kappa_lbte` becomes"
msgstr ""
":math:`\\Omega` の流入散乱部分を落とすと "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}_{\\lambda}=\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda}\\tau_{\\lambda}`"
" となり、式 :eq:`kappa_lbte` は次のようになります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:657
msgid ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\nu}(T) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(T)\\,W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu}\\,\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(T),"
"\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} = \\sum_{j'\\in\\mathcal{B}(j)} "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu},"
msgstr ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\nu}(T) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(T)\\,W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu}\\,\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(T),"
"\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} = \\sum_{j'\\in\\mathcal{B}(j)} "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:663
msgid ""
"where :math:`V` is the unit cell volume, :math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\partial n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/\\partial "
"T`, :math:`\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(T)` is the phonon lifetime, and "
":math:`\\mathcal{B}(j)` is the set of branches degenerate with :math:`j` "
"at :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` (see below). For a non-degenerate branch "
":math:`W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} = "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu}` and the familiar "
"expression is recovered. For a degenerate multiplet the sum of :math:`W` "
"over its members is"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`V` は単位胞の体積、:math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\partial n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/\\partial "
"T`、:math:`\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}(T)` はフォノン寿命、:math:`\\mathcal{B}(j)` は "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` において :math:`j` と縮退しているバンドの集合です (後述)。縮退のないバンドでは "
":math:`W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu} = "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu}` "
"となり、よく知られた表式に帰着します。縮退多重項では、その構成要素にわたる :math:`W` の和は"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:668
msgid ""
"\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal{B}} W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"= \\sum_{j,j'\\in\\mathcal{B}} "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu}\n"
"= "
"\\mathrm{Tr}\\left(P_{\\mathcal{B}}V^{\\mu}P_{\\mathcal{B}}V^{\\nu}\\right),"
msgstr ""
"\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal{B}} W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"= \\sum_{j,j'\\in\\mathcal{B}} "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu}\n"
"= "
"\\mathrm{Tr}\\left(P_{\\mathcal{B}}V^{\\mu}P_{\\mathcal{B}}V^{\\nu}\\right),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:674
msgid ""
"where :math:`V^{\\mu}` is the matrix with elements "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}` over all branches and "
":math:`P_{\\mathcal{B}}` is the projector onto the multiplet, i.e. in the"
" band basis the diagonal matrix equal to 1 for :math:`j\\in\\mathcal{B}` "
"and 0 otherwise. A unitary rotation :math:`\\mathcal{W}` of the "
"eigenvectors inside the multiplet maps "
":math:`V^{\\mu}\\to\\mathcal{W}^{\\dagger}V^{\\mu}\\mathcal{W}` and "
"leaves :math:`P_{\\mathcal{B}}` unchanged, so the trace is invariant, "
"whereas the individual products "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\nu}` are not."
" The pairs :math:`j\\neq j'` inside one multiplet are counted here and "
"are excluded from the :ref:`coherent term <kappa_coherent>`, so nothing "
"is double counted; the two together form the invariant."
msgstr ""
"となります。ここで :math:`V^{\\mu}` は全バンドにわたる要素 "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}` をもつ行列、:math:`P_{\\mathcal{B}}` "
"は多重項への射影子、すなわちバンド基底において :math:`j\\in\\mathcal{B}` で 1、それ以外で 0 "
"となる対角行列です。多重項内部での固有ベクトルのユニタリ回転 :math:`\\mathcal{W}` は "
":math:`V^{\\mu}\\to\\mathcal{W}^{\\dagger}V^{\\mu}\\mathcal{W}` "
"と写し、:math:`P_{\\mathcal{B}}` を変えないため、このトレースは不変ですが、個々の積 "
":math:`v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj}^{\\nu}` "
"は不変ではありません。1 つの多重項内の :math:`j\\neq j'` の対はここで数えられ、:ref:`コヒーレント項 "
"<kappa_coherent>` からは除外されるため、二重に数えられることはありません。両者を合わせたものが不変量をなします。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:681
msgid ""
"This assignment is a convention, not a physical distinction. At exact "
"degeneracy the coherent expression of Ref. [Simoncelli2022]_ reduces to "
"the Peierls form for such a pair, so the total conductivity is the same "
"whichever term the pair is assigned to; the assignment only makes each "
"part separately basis invariant. The *particle-like* part defined here "
"therefore equals the *populations* of Ref. [Simoncelli2022]_ plus the "
"coherences between degenerate branches, and differs from their "
"populations wherever multiplets occur. For symmetry-enforced degeneracies"
" the multiplet is a well-defined object and the definition is exact; for "
"accidental near-degeneracies it depends on the numerical tolerance below,"
" whose effect on the total is the factor reported by the warning "
"described there. Only the total should be compared between calculations "
"or with Ref. [Simoncelli2022]_."
msgstr ""
"この割り当ては規約であり、物理的な区別ではありません。厳密な縮退においては、文献 [Simoncelli2022]_ "
"のコヒーレント項の表式はそのような対に対して Peierls "
"型に帰着するため、対をどちらの項に割り当てても全熱伝導率は同じです。割り当ては、各部分を個別に基底不変にするためのものにすぎません。したがって、ここで定義される"
" *粒子的* (particle-like) な部分は、文献 [Simoncelli2022]_ の *populations* "
"に縮退バンド間のコヒーレンスを加えたものに等しく、多重項が現れる箇所では彼らの populations "
"とは異なります。対称性によって強制される縮退では多重項は明確に定義された対象であり、この定義は厳密です。偶然の準縮退では、以下で述べる数値的な許容値に依存し、その全体への影響は、そこで説明する警告で報告される因子です。計算間の比較や文献"
" [Simoncelli2022]_ との比較は、全体に対してのみ行うべきです。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:689
msgid ""
"The multiplets are detected from the frequencies only. The frequency-"
"degeneracy groups over which the self-energy is averaged (tolerance "
":math:`10^{-7}` Ry) are subdivided with an anchored tolerance of "
":math:`10^{-6}\\ \\mathrm{cm}^{-1}`, so that the lifetime is constant "
"within every multiplet by construction. This is an empirical numerical "
"criterion: a pair whose true splitting :math:`\\Delta\\omega` falls below"
" it is treated as degenerate, which overestimates its weight by the "
"factor "
":math:`1+[\\Delta\\omega/(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})]^{2}`"
" relative to the coherent expression. *anphon* reports the largest such "
"ratio among the merged multiplets and warns when it exceeds 0.1."
msgstr ""
"多重項は振動数のみから検出されます。自己エネルギーの平均をとる振動数縮退グループ (許容値 :math:`10^{-7}` Ry) "
"を、アンカー付きの許容値 :math:`10^{-6}\\ \\mathrm{cm}^{-1}` "
"でさらに細分することで、構成上すべての多重項内で寿命が一定になります。これは経験的な数値基準です。真の分裂幅 "
":math:`\\Delta\\omega` がこれを下回る対は縮退として扱われ、コヒーレント項の表式に比べて重みが因子 "
":math:`1+[\\Delta\\omega/(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})]^{2}`"
" だけ過大評価されます。*anphon* は統合された多重項の中でこの比の最大値を報告し、0.1 を超える場合に警告します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:696
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Because :math:`W` is contracted for each :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` as soon "
"as the velocity matrix at that point is formed, the full matrix (of size "
":math:`N_{q}(3N_{\\kappa})^{2}\\times3`) is never stored unless the "
"coherent term is requested."
msgstr ""
":math:`W` は各 :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"点で速度行列が構成されるとすぐに縮約されるため、コヒーレント項が要求されない限り、行列全体 (サイズ "
":math:`N_{q}(3N_{\\kappa})^{2}\\times3`) が保存されることはありません。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:699
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The per-mode linewidths written to ``PREFIX.kappa.h5`` "
"(``/scattering/3ph/gamma``, ``/scattering/4ph/gamma``) and to the text "
"``.result`` files are averaged over the same frequency-degeneracy groups "
"before they are written, as the isotope linewidths are. A single mode of "
"a degenerate multiplet has no basis-independent linewidth: rotating the "
"eigenvectors inside the multiplet (a perturbation of :math:`10^{-7}` of "
"the force constants suffices) changes individual values by up to 80 %, "
"while their mean is unchanged. Since the RTA conductivity uses the "
"averaged values anyway, it is unaffected; the four-phonon rates that the "
"iterative solvers add to the diagonal of the collision operator are "
"averaged in the same way. The written values are complete for each "
"irreducible :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` only, and a restart keeps only "
"complete :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}`: the modes of a partially written one "
"(in an interrupted file, or a text ``.result`` file of version 1.x) are "
"recomputed. The ``gamma`` datasets carry the attribute ``averaging = "
"degenerate_modes_mean_1e-7Ry``; raw per-mode rates are not stored, so the"
" ``--noavg`` option of ``tools/analyzer.py`` has an effect only on "
"``.result`` files of version 1.x."
msgstr ""
"``PREFIX.kappa.h5`` (``/scattering/3ph/gamma``、``/scattering/4ph/gamma``)"
" およびテキストの ``.result`` "
"ファイルに書き出されるモードごとの線幅は、同位体線幅と同様に、書き出す前に同じ振動数縮退グループにわたって平均されます。縮退多重項の単一モードには基底に依存しない線幅が存在しません。多重項内で固有ベクトルを回転させると"
" (力定数の :math:`10^{-7}` の摂動で十分です)、個々の値は最大 80 % 変化しますが、その平均は変わりません。RTA "
"の熱伝導率はいずれにせよ平均値を用いるため、影響を受けません。反復ソルバーが衝突演算子の対角成分に加える 4 "
"フォノンのレートも同様に平均されます。書き出された値は既約な :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"ごとにのみ完全であり、リスタートでは完全な :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` のみが保持されます。部分的に書き出された "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` (中断されたファイル、またはバージョン 1.x のテキスト ``.result`` ファイル) "
"のモードは再計算されます。``gamma`` データセットは属性 ``averaging = degenerate_modes_mean_1e-"
"7Ry`` を持ちます。モードごとの生のレートは保存されないため、``tools/analyzer.py`` の ``--noavg`` "
"オプションはバージョン 1.x の ``.result`` ファイルに対してのみ効果があります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:710
msgid "The phonon lifetime is estimated using the Matthiessen's rule as"
msgstr "フォノン寿命はマティーセンの規則 (Matthiessen's rule) を用いて次のように見積もられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:712
msgid ""
"\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{-1}(T) = 2 "
"(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{3rd}}(T) + "
"\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{4ph}}(T) + "
"\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{iso}}),"
msgstr ""
"\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{-1}(T) = 2 "
"(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{3rd}}(T) + "
"\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{4ph}}(T) + "
"\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mathrm{iso}}),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:716
msgid ""
"where the four-phonon term :eq:`gamma4ph` is included only when "
"``INCLUDE_4PH = 1``."
msgstr "ここで 4 フォノン散乱の項 :eq:`gamma4ph` は ``INCLUDE_4PH = 1`` のときのみ含まれます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:718
msgid ""
"When boundary scattering is included (``LEN_BOUNDARY``), the additional "
"rate :math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}|/L` uses, for a "
"degenerate multiplet, the block mean speed "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}|^{2}=d_{\\mathcal{B}}^{-1}\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal{B}}\\sum_{\\mu}W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\mu}`,"
" which is likewise basis invariant."
msgstr ""
"境界散乱を含める場合 (``LEN_BOUNDARY``)、追加の散乱レート "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}|/L` には、縮退多重項に対してブロック平均速さ "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}|^{2}=d_{\\mathcal{B}}^{-1}\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal{B}}\\sum_{\\mu}W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu\\mu}`"
" を用います。これも同様に基底不変です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:724
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"With this formulation the conductivity does not depend on the choice of "
"unit cell: a primitive cell and a commensurate supercell sampling the "
"same :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` points give identical :math:`\\kappa` (to "
":math:`10^{-15}` relative in a silicon test) when a fixed-width smearing "
"(``ISMEAR = 0`` or ``1``) is used. The tetrahedron method (``ISMEAR = "
"-1``) interpolates frequencies at fixed sorted branch indices and its "
"linewidths remain cell dependent at the few-percent level; the adaptive "
"smearing (``ISMEAR = 2``) and the iterative solvers (``SOLVER = IBTE`` "
"and variants) still use finite-difference velocities and are cell "
"dependent as well."
msgstr ""
"この定式化では、熱伝導率は単位胞の選び方に依存しません。固定幅のスメアリング (``ISMEAR = 0`` または ``1``) "
"を用いる場合、同じ :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` 点をサンプリングする基本胞とそれに整合するスーパーセルは同一の "
":math:`\\kappa` を与えます (シリコンでのテストでは相対誤差 :math:`10^{-15}` 以内)。テトラヘドロン法 "
"(``ISMEAR = -1``) "
"はソートされたバンドインデックスを固定して振動数を補間するため、その線幅は数パーセントのレベルでセルに依存したままです。適応スメアリング "
"(``ISMEAR = 2``) と反復ソルバー (``SOLVER = IBTE`` およびその変種) "
"は依然として有限差分の速度を用いるため、同様にセルに依存します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:731
msgid "The lattice thermal conductivity is saved in the file ``PREFIX``.kl."
msgstr "格子熱伝導率はファイル ``PREFIX``.kl に保存されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:733
msgid ""
"The spectra of the lattice thermal conductivity "
":math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega)` can also be calculated"
" by setting ``KAPPA_SPEC = 1`` in the ``&kappa`` field. "
":math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega)` is defined as"
msgstr ""
"格子熱伝導率のスペクトル :math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega)` "
"も、``&kappa`` フィールドで ``KAPPA_SPEC = 1`` "
"を設定することで計算できます。:math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega)` "
"は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:735
msgid ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega) = \\frac{1}{V "
"N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}"
" \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}).\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega) = \\frac{1}{V "
"N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}"
" \\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}).\n"
"\n"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:738
msgid ""
"If we integrate this quantity over :math:`\\omega`, we then obtain the "
"bulk thermal conductivity, namely "
":math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu} = \\int_{0}^{\\infty} "
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega) \\; \\mathrm{d}\\omega`."
msgstr ""
"この量を :math:`\\omega` について積分すると、バルクの熱伝導率、すなわち "
":math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu} = \\int_{0}^{\\infty} "
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}^{\\mu\\mu}(\\omega) \\; \\mathrm{d}\\omega` "
"が得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:740
msgid ""
"The RTA treats every scattering event as if it simply destroyed the "
"excess of phonons in mode :math:`\\lambda`. In reality a collision also "
"*creates* excess phonons in the partner modes, and for momentum-"
"conserving (Normal) processes this in-scattering keeps the heat current "
"flowing. Neglecting it makes the RTA underestimate :math:`\\kappa`, "
"sometimes by a large factor in materials with weak Umklapp scattering "
"(diamond, BAs, graphene, or any crystal at low temperature). The three "
"solvers below keep the in-scattering term of :math:`\\Omega`; for the "
"same mesh and smearing they converge to the same :math:`\\kappa`, which "
"is written to ``PREFIX``.kl_iter."
msgstr ""
"RTA では、すべての散乱事象がモード :math:`\\lambda` "
"の過剰フォノンを単に消滅させるものとして扱われます。実際には、衝突は相手モードに過剰フォノンを *生成* もしており、運動量を保存する (正常 "
"(Normal)) 過程ではこの流入散乱が熱流を維持します。これを無視すると RTA は :math:`\\kappa` "
"を過小評価し、ウムクラップ散乱が弱い物質 (ダイヤモンド、BAs、グラフェン、あるいは低温での任意の結晶) "
"では大きな因子で過小評価することがあります。以下の 3 つのソルバーは :math:`\\Omega` "
"の流入散乱項を保持します。同じメッシュとスメアリングに対してこれらは同じ :math:`\\kappa` に収束し、その結果は "
"``PREFIX``.kl_iter に書き出されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:750
msgid "Iterative solution (``SOLVER = IBTE``)"
msgstr "反復解法 (``SOLVER = IBTE``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:752
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Starting from the RTA, "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}^{(0)}_{\\lambda}=\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda}\\tau_{\\lambda}`,"
" the in-scattering term is evaluated with the previous iterate and the "
"diagonal is inverted:"
msgstr ""
"RTA "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}^{(0)}_{\\lambda}=\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda}\\tau_{\\lambda}`"
" から出発し、流入散乱項を前回の反復値で評価して対角成分を反転します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:755
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i+1)}_{\\lambda} = "
"\\tau_{\\lambda}\\Big[\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda} - "
"\\sum_{\\lambda'\\neq\\lambda}\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda'}\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i)}_{\\lambda'}\\Big]."
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i+1)}_{\\lambda} = "
"\\tau_{\\lambda}\\Big[\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\lambda} - "
"\\sum_{\\lambda'\\neq\\lambda}\\Omega_{\\lambda\\lambda'}\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i)}_{\\lambda'}\\Big]."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:759
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The new iterate is mixed with the old one, "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}\\leftarrow\\alpha\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i+1)}+(1-\\alpha)\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i)}`"
" with :math:`\\alpha` = ``IBTE_MIXING``, and the iteration stops when the"
" relative residual "
":math:`\\|\\Omega\\boldsymbol{F}-\\boldsymbol{v}\\|/\\|\\boldsymbol{v}\\|`"
" falls below ``ITER_THRESHOLD`` (after at least ``MIN_CYCLE`` and at most"
" ``MAX_CYCLE`` iterations). The residual of the current iterate comes at "
"no extra cost from the update itself; the stored :math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` "
"is the iterate whose residual was tested, not the update computed "
"alongside it. This scheme is simple and each iteration costs one "
"application of :math:`\\Omega`, but it converges slowly, or oscillates, "
"when in-scattering is strong (low temperature, very high "
":math:`\\kappa`). A mixing factor below 1 damps the oscillation."
msgstr ""
"新しい反復値は古いものと "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}\\leftarrow\\alpha\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i+1)}+(1-\\alpha)\\boldsymbol{F}^{(i)}`"
" (:math:`\\alpha` = ``IBTE_MIXING``) のように混合され、相対残差 "
":math:`\\|\\Omega\\boldsymbol{F}-\\boldsymbol{v}\\|/\\|\\boldsymbol{v}\\|`"
" が ``ITER_THRESHOLD`` を下回ると反復は停止します (ただし反復回数は最低 ``MIN_CYCLE`` 回、最大 "
"``MAX_CYCLE`` 回)。現在の反復値の残差は更新そのものから追加コストなしに得られます。保存される "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` "
"は残差が判定された反復値であり、それと同時に計算された更新値ではありません。この方法は単純で、各反復のコストは :math:`\\Omega` を"
" 1 回作用させる分だけですが、流入散乱が強い場合 (低温、非常に大きな :math:`\\kappa`) "
"には収束が遅くなったり、振動したりします。1 より小さい混合係数は振動を減衰させます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:769
msgid "Variational solution (``SOLVER = VBTE``)"
msgstr "変分解法 (``SOLVER = VBTE``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:771
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Because :math:`\\Omega` is symmetric and positive semidefinite (a "
"consequence of detailed balance), the solution of equation :eq:`lbte` is "
"also the extremum of the quadratic functional "
":math:`\\mathcal{F}[\\boldsymbol{F}]=\\tfrac{1}{2}\\boldsymbol{F}\\cdot\\Omega\\boldsymbol{F}-\\boldsymbol{F}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{v}`,"
" and :math:`\\kappa` is its value at the extremum [Fugallo2013]_. "
"*anphon* finds it with the preconditioned conjugate-gradient method. Two "
"practical consequences follow: the iteration cannot oscillate, and an "
"approximate :math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` with residual "
":math:`\\epsilon=\\|\\Omega\\boldsymbol{F}-\\boldsymbol{v}\\|/\\|\\boldsymbol{v}\\|`"
" gives :math:`\\kappa` with an error of order :math:`\\epsilon^{2}`. For "
"``VBTE``, ``ITER_THRESHOLD`` is therefore the tolerance on this relative "
"residual, and ``MIN_CYCLE`` and ``IBTE_MIXING`` are ignored. ``VBTE`` "
"usually needs far fewer iterations than ``IBTE`` and is the recommended "
"choice when ``IBTE`` converges slowly. The tetrahedron and adaptive "
"integration weights make the discretized :math:`\\Omega` slightly non-"
"symmetric, and the conjugate-gradient iteration then stagnates or breaks "
"down at low temperature and when Normal processes dominate. For these "
"weights (``ISMEAR = -1, 2``), ``VBTE`` therefore uses the BiCGSTAB "
"method, which does not require a symmetric operator; the variational "
"property is lost, so the error of :math:`\\kappa` is then linear in the "
"residual."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\Omega` は対称かつ半正定値である (詳細釣り合いの帰結) ため、式 :eq:`lbte` の解は 2 次汎関数 "
":math:`\\mathcal{F}[\\boldsymbol{F}]=\\tfrac{1}{2}\\boldsymbol{F}\\cdot\\Omega\\boldsymbol{F}-\\boldsymbol{F}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{v}`"
" の極値でもあり、:math:`\\kappa` はその極値における値です [Fugallo2013]_。*anphon* "
"はこれを前処理付き共役勾配法で求めます。これには 2 つの実用上の帰結があります。反復は振動し得ないこと、および残差 "
":math:`\\epsilon=\\|\\Omega\\boldsymbol{F}-\\boldsymbol{v}\\|/\\|\\boldsymbol{v}\\|`"
" をもつ近似的な :math:`\\boldsymbol{F}` は :math:`\\epsilon^{2}` 程度の誤差で "
":math:`\\kappa` を与えることです。したがって ``VBTE`` では、``ITER_THRESHOLD`` "
"はこの相対残差に対する許容値であり、``MIN_CYCLE`` と ``IBTE_MIXING`` は無視されます。``VBTE`` は通常 "
"``IBTE`` よりはるかに少ない反復回数で済み、``IBTE`` "
"の収束が遅い場合に推奨される選択肢です。四面体法および適応的な積分重みは離散化した :math:`\\Omega` "
"をわずかに非対称にするため、低温や正常過程が支配的な場合には共役勾配法の反復が停滞したり破綻したりします。そこでこれらの重み (``ISMEAR "
"= -1, 2``) に対しては、``VBTE`` は対称な演算子を必要としない BiCGSTAB "
"法を用います。この場合は変分性が失われるため、:math:`\\kappa` の誤差は残差について 1 次になります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:785
msgid "Direct solution (``SOLVER = DBTE``)"
msgstr "直接解法 (``SOLVER = DBTE``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:787
msgid ""
"The collision operator restricted to the irreducible wedge is assembled "
"as an explicit dense matrix and fully diagonalized, "
":math:`\\Omega=\\sum_{n}\\lambda_{n}\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}^{\\mathsf{T}}`,"
" so that equation :eq:`lbte` is solved exactly as "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}=\\sum_{n}\\lambda_{n}^{-1}(\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{v})\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}`"
" [Chaput2013]_. The eigenvalues :math:`\\lambda_{n}` are the scattering "
"rates of collective relaxation modes (printed in cm\\ :sup:`-1`). Energy "
"conservation makes one eigenvalue exactly zero, and near-zero eigenvalues"
" with a large overlap onto the momentum-drift directions signal that "
"Normal processes dominate, the regime where the RTA fails most. Negative "
"eigenvalues or a strongly asymmetric matrix indicate that the "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` mesh or the smearing width is not adequate. "
"``DBTE`` is thus a diagnostic tool: its memory grows with the square of "
"the number of irreducible modes, so it is intended for small meshes. The "
"matrix is symmetrized before the diagonalization, so ``DBTE`` is an exact"
" reference for the two iterative solvers only for fixed-width smearing; "
"with the tetrahedron or adaptive weights it solves the symmetrized "
"kernel, which differs from the one ``IBTE`` and ``VBTE`` solve by terms "
"that vanish as the mesh is refined."
msgstr ""
"既約ウェッジに制限した衝突演算子を明示的な密行列として組み立て、完全に対角化します "
"(:math:`\\Omega=\\sum_{n}\\lambda_{n}\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}^{\\mathsf{T}}`)。これにより式"
" :eq:`lbte` は "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{F}=\\sum_{n}\\lambda_{n}^{-1}(\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{v})\\boldsymbol{u}_{n}`"
" として厳密に解かれます [Chaput2013]_。固有値 :math:`\\lambda_{n}` は集団的な緩和モードの散乱レートです "
"(cm\\ :sup:`-1` 単位で出力されます)。エネルギー保存により 1 "
"つの固有値は厳密にゼロになり、運動量ドリフト方向への重なりが大きいゼロ近傍の固有値は、正常過程が支配的であること、すなわち RTA "
"が最も破綻する領域にあることを示します。負の固有値や強く非対称な行列は、:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"メッシュやスメアリング幅が不十分であることを示します。このように ``DBTE`` は診断ツールです。そのメモリ使用量は既約モード数の 2 "
"乗で増加するため、小さなメッシュを対象としています。行列は対角化の前に対称化されるため、``DBTE`` が 2 "
"つの反復ソルバーに対する厳密な参照値となるのは固定幅のスメアリングの場合のみです。四面体法または適応的な重みの場合は対称化された核を解くことになり、これは"
" ``IBTE`` と ``VBTE`` が解く核とは、メッシュを細かくすると消える項だけ異なります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:801
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The three non-RTA solvers currently use finite-difference group "
"velocities and are therefore cell dependent at the level discussed in the"
" :ref:`velocity section <group_velocity>`. Please check the convergence "
"of :math:`\\kappa` with respect to the :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` mesh and "
"the smearing width carefully."
msgstr ""
"3 つの非 RTA ソルバーは現在有限差分の群速度を用いているため、:ref:`群速度の節 <group_velocity>` "
"で述べたレベルでセルに依存します。:math:`\\kappa` の :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"メッシュおよびスメアリング幅に関する収束を注意深く確認してください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:808
msgid "Coherent term"
msgstr "コヒーレント項 (coherent term)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:810
msgid ""
"The coherent components of lattice thermal conductivity (see Ref. "
"[Simoncelli2019]_), which are associated with the band off-diagonal "
"components of the harmonic heat-flux operator, are calculated as"
msgstr ""
"格子熱伝導率のコヒーレント成分 (文献 [Simoncelli2019]_ 参照) "
"は、調和熱流束演算子のバンド非対角成分に関連するもので、次のように計算されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:812
msgid ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{c}}^{\\mu\\nu}(T) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\substack{\\boldsymbol{q},jj'\\\\ j\\neq "
"j'}}\\frac{c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'} + "
"c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+"
" \\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}}  "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu} "
"\\frac{\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}}{(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})^{2}+(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})^2},"
msgstr ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{c}}^{\\mu\\nu}(T) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\substack{\\boldsymbol{q},jj'\\\\ j\\neq "
"j'}}\\frac{c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'} + "
"c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}{\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+"
" \\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}}  "
"v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu} "
"\\frac{\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}}{(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}-\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})^{2}+(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})^2},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:816
msgid ""
"where :math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\partial n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/\\partial "
"T` and :math:`\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` is the total phonon linewidth "
"(half width) of phonon mode :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j`."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j} = "
"\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\partial n_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/\\partial "
"T` であり、:math:`\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` はフォノンモード "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}j` の全フォノン線幅 (半値幅) です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:818
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}` is the band off-diagonal "
"velocity matrix :eq:`velmat`, built from :math:`\\tilde{D}` [Allen1993]_ "
"[Simoncelli2022]_. The sum runs over pairs belonging to *different* "
"degenerate multiplets; pairs inside one multiplet are already contained "
"in the :ref:`Peierls term <kappa_peierls>`. For such a pair "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}=\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}`, the "
"prefactor reduces to :math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` and the Lorentzian "
"factor to "
":math:`1/(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})`; since"
" the lifetime is constant within a multiplet this equals "
":math:`1/(2\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})=\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`, i.e. "
"exactly the Peierls weight "
":math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`,"
" so the two terms together form the basis-invariant block trace. The "
"particle-like/wave-like *split* is therefore basis dependent while their "
"sum is not; only the total should be compared between calculations. When "
"``KAPPA_COHERENT = 1 | 2`` the coherent component is calculated and saved"
" in ``PREFIX``.kl_coherent. When ``KAPPA_COHERENT = 2``, all components "
"of the coherent term before summation are saved in ``PREFIX``.kc_elem. "
"Requesting the coherent term stores the full velocity matrix, "
":math:`N_{q}(3N_{\\kappa})^{2}\\times3` complex numbers on the root "
"process."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}` はバンド非対角の速度行列 :eq:`velmat` "
"で、:math:`\\tilde{D}` から構成されます [Allen1993]_ [Simoncelli2022]_。和は *異なる* "
"縮退多重項に属する対にわたってとり、1 つの多重項内の対はすでに :ref:`Peierls 項 <kappa_peierls>` "
"に含まれています。そのような対では "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}=\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'}` であり、前因子は "
":math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` に、ローレンツ因子は "
":math:`1/(\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}+\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'})` "
"に帰着します。多重項内では寿命が一定なので、これは "
":math:`1/(2\\Gamma_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})=\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` "
"に等しく、すなわち Peierls 項の重み "
":math:`c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj'}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j'j}^{\\nu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}`"
" そのものになるため、2 つの項を合わせると基底不変なブロックトレースになります。したがって粒子的/波動的な *分割* "
"は基底に依存しますが、その和は依存しません。計算間で比較すべきは全体のみです。``KAPPA_COHERENT = 1 | 2`` "
"のとき、コヒーレント成分が計算され ``PREFIX``.kl_coherent に保存されます。``KAPPA_COHERENT = 2`` "
"のとき、和をとる前のコヒーレント項のすべての成分が ``PREFIX``.kc_elem "
"に保存されます。コヒーレント項を要求すると、速度行列全体、すなわち :math:`N_{q}(3N_{\\kappa})^{2}\\times3`"
" 個の複素数がルートプロセスに保存されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:833
msgid "Cumulative thermal conductivity"
msgstr "累積熱伝導率 (cumulative thermal conductivity)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:835
msgid ""
"The accumulative lattice thermal conductivity "
":math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph,acc}}^{\\mu\\nu}(L)` is defined as"
msgstr "累積格子熱伝導率 :math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph,acc}}^{\\mu\\nu}(L)` は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:837
msgid ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph,acc}}^{\\mu\\nu}(L) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\Theta"
" (L-|\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}|\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}),"
msgstr ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph,acc}}^{\\mu\\nu}(L) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\Theta"
" (L-|\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}|\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:841
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Theta(x)` is the step function. This quantity can be "
"calculated by using the script ``analyzer.py`` with ``--calc cumulative``"
" flag. With the default velocity-matrix formulation ``analyzer.py`` "
"replaces :math:`v^{\\mu}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v^{\\nu}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` "
"by the degenerate-block diad :math:`W^{\\mu\\nu}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` "
"stored in ``PREFIX.kappa.h5`` (and "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}|` by "
":math:`\\sqrt{\\mathrm{tr}\\,W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}`), so that the "
"large-:math:`L` limit coincides with :math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}` of "
"the ``anphon`` run; text ``.result`` files, which carry no velocity "
"matrix, fall back to the finite-difference velocities. One can also use "
"another definition for the accumulative thermal conductivity:"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\Theta(x)` はステップ関数です。この量は、スクリプト ``analyzer.py`` を ``--calc "
"cumulative`` フラグ付きで用いて計算できます。デフォルトの速度行列による定式化では、``analyzer.py`` は "
":math:`v^{\\mu}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v^{\\nu}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` を "
"``PREFIX.kappa.h5`` に保存された縮退ブロックのダイアド "
":math:`W^{\\mu\\nu}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` で (また "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}|` を "
":math:`\\sqrt{\\mathrm{tr}\\,W_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}` で) 置き換えるため、:math:`L` "
"の大きい極限は ``anphon`` 実行の :math:`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph}}` "
"と一致します。速度行列を含まないテキストの ``.result`` "
"ファイルでは、有限差分の速度にフォールバックします。累積熱伝導率には別の定義を用いることもできます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:849
msgid ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph,acc}}^{\\mu\\nu}(L) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\Theta"
" (L-|v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}|\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})."
msgstr ""
"\\kappa_{\\mathrm{ph,acc}}^{\\mu\\nu}(L) = \\frac{1}{V N_{q}} "
"\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q},j}c_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\nu}\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\\Theta"
" (L-|v_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{\\mu}|\\tau_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:853
msgid ""
"In this case, the contribution to the total thermal conductivity is "
"limited only from phonon modes whose mean-free-path along the "
":math:`\\mu`\\ -direction is smaller than :math:`L`. To calculate this, "
"please use the ``--calc cumulative2`` flag and specify the direction "
":math:`\\mu` by the ``--direction`` option."
msgstr ""
"この場合、全熱伝導率への寄与は、:math:`\\mu`\\ 方向に沿った平均自由行程が :math:`L` "
"より小さいフォノンモードのみに限定されます。これを計算するには、``--calc cumulative2`` "
"フラグを用い、``--direction`` オプションで方向 :math:`\\mu` を指定してください。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:859
msgid "Delta function"
msgstr "デルタ関数 (delta function)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:861
msgid ""
"To compute the phonon DOSs and the imaginary part of phonon self-"
"energies, it is necessary to evaluate the Brillouin-zone integration "
"containing Dirac's delta function. For that purpose, we provide four "
"options through the ``ISMEAR``-tag. The four-phonon scattering rates use "
"the separate ``ISMEAR_4PH`` and ``EPSILON_4PH`` tags with the same "
"meaning."
msgstr ""
"フォノン DOS "
"とフォノン自己エネルギーの虚部を計算するには、ディラックのデルタ関数を含むブリルアンゾーン積分を評価する必要があります。そのために、``ISMEAR``"
" タグを通じて 4 つのオプションを提供しています。4 フォノン散乱レートには、同じ意味をもつ別のタグ ``ISMEAR_4PH`` と "
"``EPSILON_4PH`` が使われます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:867
msgid "Lorentzian smearing (``ISMEAR = 0``)"
msgstr "ローレンツ型スメアリング (``ISMEAR = 0``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:869
msgid "The delta function is replaced by the Lorentzian function as"
msgstr "デルタ関数は次のようにローレンツ関数で置き換えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:871
msgid ""
"\\delta(\\omega) \\approx "
"\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\omega^{2}+\\epsilon^{2}}."
msgstr ""
"\\delta(\\omega) \\approx "
"\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\omega^{2}+\\epsilon^{2}}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:876
msgid "Gaussian smearing (``ISMEAR = 1``)"
msgstr "ガウス型スメアリング (``ISMEAR = 1``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:878
msgid "The delta function is replaced by the Gaussian function as"
msgstr "デルタ関数は次のようにガウス関数で置き換えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:880
msgid ""
"\\delta(\\omega) \\approx "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}\\epsilon}\\exp{(-\\omega^{2}/\\epsilon^{2})},"
msgstr ""
"\\delta(\\omega) \\approx "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}\\epsilon}\\exp{(-\\omega^{2}/\\epsilon^{2})},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:884
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"which decays faster than the Lorentzian function. For both smearing "
"methods, :math:`\\epsilon` should be given by the ``EPSILON``-tag, which "
"must be chosen carefully to avoid any unscientific results. "
":math:`\\epsilon` should be small enough to capture detailed phonon "
"structures such as phonon DOS or energy conservation surface related to "
"three-phonon processes, but it should be large enough to avoid "
"unscientific oscillations. Choosing an appropriate value for "
":math:`\\epsilon` is not a trivial task since it may depend on the phonon"
" structure and the density of :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` points."
msgstr ""
"これはローレンツ関数より速く減衰します。どちらのスメアリング法でも、:math:`\\epsilon` は ``EPSILON`` "
"タグで与える必要があり、非科学的な結果を避けるために慎重に選ぶ必要があります。:math:`\\epsilon` は、フォノン DOS や 3 "
"フォノン過程に関連するエネルギー保存面などの詳細なフォノン構造を捉えるのに十分小さくあるべきですが、非科学的な振動を避けるのに十分大きくあるべきです。:math:`\\epsilon`"
" の適切な値を選ぶことは、フォノン構造や :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` 点の密度に依存し得るため、自明な作業ではありません。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:892
msgid "Adaptive smearing (``ISMEAR = 2``)"
msgstr "適応的スメアリング (``ISMEAR = 2``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:894
msgid ""
"The Gaussian form above is used, but the width is chosen automatically "
"for every term of the sum from the group velocities and the mesh spacing,"
" following the adaptive-broadening scheme of Yates *et al.* [Yates2007]_."
" For a three-phonon process in which the energy-conservation condition "
"involves :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1 "
"j_1}\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 j_2}`, the width is"
msgstr ""
"上記のガウス関数形を用いますが、その幅は Yates *et al.* [Yates2007]_ の適応的広がり (adaptive "
"broadening) 法に従い、群速度とメッシュ間隔から和の各項ごとに自動的に決められます。エネルギー保存条件に "
":math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1 j_1}\\pm\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 "
"j_2}` が現れる 3 フォノン過程に対して、幅は次式で与えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:899
msgid ""
"\\sigma = \\alpha "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{12}\\sum_{u=1}^{3}\\left[\\left(\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1"
" j_1}\\mp\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 "
"j_2}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}}{N_{u}}\\right]^{2}},"
msgstr ""
"\\sigma = \\alpha "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{12}\\sum_{u=1}^{3}\\left[\\left(\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1"
" j_1}\\mp\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 "
"j_2}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}}{N_{u}}\\right]^{2}},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:903
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}/N_{u}` are the steps of the "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` mesh along the three reciprocal lattice vectors, "
"i.e. the width is the spread of the argument of the delta function over "
"one mesh cell. For the phonon DOS only "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` enters."
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}/N_{u}` は 3 つの逆格子ベクトルに沿った "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` メッシュの刻み幅です。すなわち、この幅はデルタ関数の引数が 1 "
"つのメッシュセル内でとる広がりに対応します。フォノン DOS では "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` のみが入ります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:907
msgid ""
"For four-phonon processes (``ISMEAR_4PH = 2``) the same argument is "
"applied to equation :eq:`gamma4ph`. Since :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}` is "
"fixed by momentum conservation, :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{3} = "
"\\boldsymbol{q}-\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}-\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}`,"
" the argument :math:`\\omega+s_{1}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1 "
"j_1}+s_{2}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 j_2}+s_{3}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_3"
" j_3}` (:math:`s_{i}=\\pm 1`) of each delta function varies independently"
" with :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}` and :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}` over a "
"mesh cell, and the two spreads are added in quadrature:"
msgstr ""
"4 フォノン過程 (``ISMEAR_4PH = 2``) でも、式 :eq:`gamma4ph` "
"に同じ考え方を適用します。:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{3}` は運動量保存則により "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{3} = "
"\\boldsymbol{q}-\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}-\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{G}` "
"と決まるので、各デルタ関数の引数 :math:`\\omega+s_{1}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1 "
"j_1}+s_{2}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 j_2}+s_{3}\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}_3"
" j_3}` (:math:`s_{i}=\\pm 1`) はメッシュセル内で :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}` と "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{2}` について独立に変化し、2 つの広がりを二乗和で合成します:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:913
msgid ""
"\\sigma = \\alpha "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{12}\\sum_{u=1}^{3}\\left\\{\\left[\\left(s_{1}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1"
" j_1}-s_{3}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_3 "
"j_3}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}}{N_{u}}\\right]^{2}\n"
"+ \\left[\\left(s_{2}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 "
"j_2}-s_{3}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_3 "
"j_3}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}}{N_{u}}\\right]^{2}\\right\\}}."
msgstr ""
"\\sigma = \\alpha "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{12}\\sum_{u=1}^{3}\\left\\{\\left[\\left(s_{1}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_1"
" j_1}-s_{3}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_3 "
"j_3}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}}{N_{u}}\\right]^{2}\n"
"+ \\left[\\left(s_{2}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_2 "
"j_2}-s_{3}\\boldsymbol{v}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_3 "
"j_3}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{\\boldsymbol{b}_{u}}{N_{u}}\\right]^{2}\\right\\}}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:918
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For the splitting process "
":math:`\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3})`, for "
"instance, the velocity differences are "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}-\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}`, whereas for "
":math:`\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{3}-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})` they are "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}`. Each of the four "
"channels of equation :eq:`gamma4ph` therefore has its own width for a "
"given band triple. Here :math:`N_{u}` and the group velocities refer to "
"the four-phonon mesh (``KMESH_COARSE``), so the widths are larger on a "
"coarser mesh, as they should be. For both ``ISMEAR_4PH = 1`` and ``2`` "
"the Gaussian is truncated at :math:`|x| \\geq 2\\sigma`, where it has "
"dropped to :math:`e^{-4}\\approx 2\\%` of its peak value; this cutoff is "
"what allows the band triples outside the window to be discarded before "
"their matrix elements are formed."
msgstr ""
"例えば分裂過程 :math:`\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{3})` "
"では速度差は :math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}-\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}` と "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}` "
"であり、:math:`\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_{3}-\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})` では "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}` と "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{v}_{3}` です。したがって、あるバンドの三つ組に対して、式 "
":eq:`gamma4ph` の 4 つのチャネルはそれぞれ異なる幅を持ちます。ここで :math:`N_{u}` と群速度は 4 "
"フォノン用のメッシュ (``KMESH_COARSE``) のものであり、粗いメッシュほど幅は大きくなります。``ISMEAR_4PH = 1``"
" と ``2`` のいずれでも、ガウス関数は :math:`|x| \\geq 2\\sigma` で打ち切られます。そこでの値はピークの "
":math:`e^{-4}\\approx 2\\%` です。この打ち切りによって、窓の外にあるバンドの三つ組を行列要素の計算前に除外できます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:927
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For both the three- and four-phonon processes, the prefactor "
":math:`\\alpha` is set by the ``ADAPTIVE_FACTOR``-tag (default 1), and a "
"lower bound of :math:`2\\times10^{-5}` Ry (about 2.2 cm\\ :sup:`-1`) is "
"imposed on :math:`\\sigma`. ``EPSILON`` is not used, so no manual "
"convergence test of the width is needed; the result converges with the "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` mesh alone. The widths are built from finite-"
"difference velocities, so the result retains a weak dependence on the "
"choice of unit cell (see the :ref:`velocity section <group_velocity>`)."
msgstr ""
"3 フォノン過程と 4 フォノン過程のいずれでも、前因子 :math:`\\alpha` は ``ADAPTIVE_FACTOR`` "
"タグで設定され (既定値 1)、:math:`\\sigma` には :math:`2\\times10^{-5}` Ry (約 2.2 cm\\"
" :sup:`-1`) の下限が課されます。``EPSILON`` は使用されないため、幅の手動での収束テストは不要で、結果は "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"メッシュのみに関して収束します。幅は有限差分の群速度から構成されるため、結果には単位胞の選び方への弱い依存性が残ります (:ref:`群速度の節 "
"<group_velocity>` を参照)。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:934
msgid "Tetrahedron method (``ISMEAR = -1``)"
msgstr "四面体法 (``ISMEAR = -1``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:936
msgid ""
"The program *anphon* employs the tetrahedron method [Blochl1994]_ by "
"default for numerical evaluations of Brillouin zone integration "
"containing :math:`\\delta(\\omega)`. When the tetrahedron method is used,"
" the ``EPSILON``-tag is neglected. We recommend using the tetrahedron "
"method whenever possible. It is not available for the four-phonon "
"scattering rates, for which ``ISMEAR_4PH = -1`` is automatically switched"
" to the adaptive smearing."
msgstr ""
"プログラム *anphon* は、:math:`\\delta(\\omega)` を含むブリルアンゾーン積分の数値評価に、既定で四面体法 "
"(tetrahedron method) [Blochl1994]_ を用います。四面体法を用いる場合、``EPSILON`` "
"タグは無視されます。可能な限り四面体法を用いることを推奨します。四面体法は 4 フォノン散乱レートには利用できず、``ISMEAR_4PH = "
"-1`` は自動的に適応的スメアリングに切り替えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:945
msgid "Self-consistent phonon (SCPH) calculation"
msgstr "自己無撞着フォノン (SCPH) 計算"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:947
msgid ""
"The self-consistent phonon mode (``MODE = SCPH``) computes temperature-"
"dependent phonon frequencies by solving the following equation self-"
"consistently [Tadano2015]_:"
msgstr ""
"自己無撞着フォノンモード (``MODE = SCPH``) は、次の方程式を自己無撞着に解くことで、温度依存のフォノン振動数を計算します "
"[Tadano2015]_。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:949
msgid ""
"V_{\\boldsymbol{q}ij}^{[n]} = "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{2}\\delta_{ij}+\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},k,\\ell}F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},ijk\\ell}\\mathcal{K}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},k\\ell}^{[n-1]}."
msgstr ""
"V_{\\boldsymbol{q}ij}^{[n]} = "
"\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{2}\\delta_{ij}+\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},k,\\ell}F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},ijk\\ell}\\mathcal{K}_{\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},k\\ell}^{[n-1]}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:954
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` is the harmonic phonon frequency"
" and :math:`F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},ijk\\ell} = "
"\\Phi(-\\boldsymbol{q}i;\\boldsymbol{q}j;\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}k;-\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}\\ell)`"
" is the reciprocal representation of fourth-order force constants "
"computed using the harmonic eigenvectors. The updated phonon frequency in"
" the :math:`n`\\ th iteration is obtained by diagonalizing the matrix "
":math:`V_{\\boldsymbol{q}ij}^{[n]}` as"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}` "
"は調和フォノン振動数であり、:math:`F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},ijk\\ell} = "
"\\Phi(-\\boldsymbol{q}i;\\boldsymbol{q}j;\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}k;-\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}\\ell)`"
" は調和固有ベクトルを用いて計算された 4 次の力定数の逆空間表現です。:math:`n`\\ 回目の反復における更新されたフォノン振動数は、行列"
" :math:`V_{\\boldsymbol{q}ij}^{[n]}` を次のように対角化して得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:956
msgid ""
"\\Lambda^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} = "
"C^{[n]\\dagger}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}V^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}},"
msgstr ""
"\\Lambda^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} = "
"C^{[n]\\dagger}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}V^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:960
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{[n]} = "
"(\\Lambda^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj})^{\\frac{1}{2}}` and "
":math:`C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` is the unitary matrix that transforms "
"the harmonic phonon eigenvectors into anharmonic ones as "
":math:`W^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} = "
"W_{\\boldsymbol{q}}C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}`. The matrix "
":math:`\\mathcal{K}` in Eq. :eq:`scph_v_iter` is defined as"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}^{[n]} = "
"(\\Lambda^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}jj})^{\\frac{1}{2}}` "
"であり、:math:`C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` は :math:`W^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} "
"= W_{\\boldsymbol{q}}C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` "
"のように調和フォノン固有ベクトルを非調和なものに変換するユニタリ行列です。式 :eq:`scph_v_iter` の行列 "
":math:`\\mathcal{K}` は次のように定義されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:962
msgid ""
"\\mathcal{K}_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]} &= \\alpha "
"K_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]} + (1-\\alpha) "
"K_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n-1]},  \\\\\n"
"K_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]}\n"
"&= \\sum_{k} C_{\\boldsymbol{q},ik}^{[n]} C_{\\boldsymbol{q},jk}^{[n]*} "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\big[1+2n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}k}^{[n]})\\big]}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}k}^{[n]}}"
"\n"
"= (C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} Q^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} "
"C^{[n]\\dagger}_{\\boldsymbol{q}})_{ij},\\\\\n"
"Q_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]}\n"
"&= "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\big[1+2n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{[n]})\\big]}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{[n]}}\\delta_{ij}."
msgstr ""
"\\mathcal{K}_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]} &= \\alpha "
"K_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]} + (1-\\alpha) "
"K_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n-1]},  \\\\\n"
"K_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]}\n"
"&= \\sum_{k} C_{\\boldsymbol{q},ik}^{[n]} C_{\\boldsymbol{q},jk}^{[n]*} "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\big[1+2n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}k}^{[n]})\\big]}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}k}^{[n]}}"
"\n"
"= (C^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} Q^{[n]}_{\\boldsymbol{q}} "
"C^{[n]\\dagger}_{\\boldsymbol{q}})_{ij},\\\\\n"
"Q_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]}\n"
"&= "
"\\frac{\\hbar\\big[1+2n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{[n]})\\big]}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{[n]}}\\delta_{ij}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:971
msgid ""
":math:`\\alpha` is the mixing parameter, which can be changed via the "
"``MIXALPHA`` tag, and :math:`n(\\omega)` is the Bose-Einstein "
"distribution function."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\alpha` は混合パラメータで、``MIXALPHA`` タグで変更でき、:math:`n(\\omega)` "
"はボース・アインシュタイン分布関数です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:973
msgid ""
"When ``CLASSICAL = 1`` is given in input, the expectation value of the "
"mean square displacement is computed using classical statistics, where "
"the :math:`Q_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` matrix is replaced by"
msgstr ""
"入力で ``CLASSICAL = 1`` "
"が指定された場合、平均二乗変位の期待値は古典統計を用いて計算され、:math:`Q_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` "
"行列は次のように置き換えられます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:975
msgid ""
"Q_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]} = "
"\\frac{k_{B}T}{(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{[n]})^{2}} \\delta_{ij}."
msgstr ""
"Q_{\\boldsymbol{q},ij}^{[n]} = "
"\\frac{k_{B}T}{(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}i}^{[n]})^{2}} \\delta_{ij}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:979
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The SCPH equation is solved on the irreducible :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"grid defined by the ``KMESH_INTERPOLATE`` tag. The "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}` grid in Eq. :eq:`scph_v_iter`, given  by the "
"``KMESH_SCPH`` tag, can be finer than the :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` grid. "
"After the SCPH iteration converges, the code computes the anharmonic "
"correction to the harmonic force constant :math:`\\Delta "
"D(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))` as follows:"
msgstr ""
"SCPH 方程式は、``KMESH_INTERPOLATE`` タグで定義された既約 :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` "
"グリッド上で解かれます。式 :eq:`scph_v_iter` の :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}_{1}` "
"グリッドは、``KMESH_SCPH`` タグで与えられ、:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` グリッドより細かくできます。SCPH "
"反復が収束した後、コードは調和力定数に対する非調和補正 :math:`\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))` "
"を次のように計算します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:983
msgid ""
"&\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}} \\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{q}) "
"e^{-i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)}, \\\\\n"
"&\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{q}) = D_{\\mathrm{SCPH}}(\\boldsymbol{q}) - "
"D_{\\mathrm{Harmonic}}(\\boldsymbol{q}), \\\\\n"
"&D_{\\mathrm{SCPH}}(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"W_{\\boldsymbol{q}}C_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{[n]}\\Lambda_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{[n]}C_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{[n]\\dagger}W_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{\\dagger}."
msgstr ""
"&\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)) = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}} \\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{q}) "
"e^{-i\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)}, \\\\\n"
"&\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{q}) = D_{\\mathrm{SCPH}}(\\boldsymbol{q}) - "
"D_{\\mathrm{Harmonic}}(\\boldsymbol{q}), \\\\\n"
"&D_{\\mathrm{SCPH}}(\\boldsymbol{q}) = "
"W_{\\boldsymbol{q}}C_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{[n]}\\Lambda_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{[n]}C_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{[n]\\dagger}W_{\\boldsymbol{q}}^{\\dagger}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:989
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))` is saved in "
"``PREFIX.scph_dfc2``."
msgstr ":math:`\\Delta D(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell))` は ``PREFIX.scph_dfc2`` に保存されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:991
msgid ""
"The most computationally expensive part is the calculation of matrix "
"elements of :math:`F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},ijk\\ell}`. When"
" ``SELF_OFFDIAG = 0`` (default), the code only computes the elements of "
":math:`F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},iikk}`. Therefore, the "
"computational complexity is "
":math:`\\mathcal{O}(N_{q}^{\\mathrm{irred.}}N_{q_{1}}m^{2})`. When "
"``SELF_OFFDIAG = 1``, the off-diagonal elements are also calculated, and "
"the computational complexity is "
":math:`\\mathcal{O}(N_{q}^{\\mathrm{irred.}}N_{q_{1}}m^{4})`."
msgstr ""
"計算上最もコストのかかる部分は、:math:`F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},ijk\\ell}` "
"の行列要素の計算です。``SELF_OFFDIAG = 0`` (デフォルト) のとき、コードは "
":math:`F_{\\boldsymbol{q}\\boldsymbol{q}_{1},iikk}` "
"の要素のみを計算します。したがって、計算量は "
":math:`\\mathcal{O}(N_{q}^{\\mathrm{irred.}}N_{q_{1}}m^{2})` "
"です。``SELF_OFFDIAG = 1`` のとき、非対角要素も計算され、計算量は "
":math:`\\mathcal{O}(N_{q}^{\\mathrm{irred.}}N_{q_{1}}m^{4})` になります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:999
msgid "Structural optimization at finite temperatures (``RELAX_STR``)"
msgstr "有限温度での構造最適化 (``RELAX_STR``)"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1001
msgid ""
"With ``MODE = SCPH`` or ``MODE = QHA`` and ``RELAX_STR > 0``, *anphon* "
"determines the crystal structure at each temperature by minimizing the "
"free energy with respect to the atomic positions and, optionally, the "
"shape of the unit cell [Oba2019]_ [Masuki2022]_ [Masuki2023]_. The force "
"constants are those of a fixed reference structure (the structure of the "
"``&cell`` field, at which the IFCs were fitted). The structure at "
"temperature :math:`T` is described relative to it, and the IFCs at that "
"structure are obtained by Taylor-expanding the potential energy surface "
"around the reference. No new DFT calculation is needed during the "
"optimization. The tutorials :doc:`../tutorial_pages/bto_scph_relax` and "
":doc:`../tutorial_pages/zno_qha_relax` show the workflow."
msgstr ""
"``MODE = SCPH`` または ``MODE = QHA`` で ``RELAX_STR > 0`` とすると、*anphon* "
"は各温度で自由エネルギーを原子位置について、また必要に応じて単位胞の形状についても最小化し、結晶構造を決定します [Oba2019]_ "
"[Masuki2022]_ [Masuki2023]_。力定数は固定された参照構造 (``&cell`` フィールドの構造で、IFC "
"をフィッティングした構造) のものです。温度 :math:`T` での構造はこの参照構造からの変化として記述され、その構造での IFC "
"は参照構造まわりのポテンシャルエネルギー曲面のテイラー展開から得られます。最適化の途中で新たな DFT "
"計算は必要ありません。計算の流れはチュートリアル :doc:`../tutorial_pages/bto_scph_relax` と "
":doc:`../tutorial_pages/zno_qha_relax` で示しています。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1010
msgid "Structural variables"
msgstr "構造の変数"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1012
msgid "Two sets of variables describe the deviation from the reference structure:"
msgstr "参照構造からのずれは次の 2 組の変数で表されます:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1014
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"the **atomic displacements** :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}(\\kappa)`, "
"uniform over all unit cells (a :math:`\\Gamma`-point distortion), which "
"are expanded in the harmonic normal coordinates of the reference "
"structure at :math:`\\Gamma`,"
msgstr ""
"**原子変位** :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}(\\kappa)`。すべての単位胞で共通 (:math:`\\Gamma`"
" 点の歪み) で、参照構造の :math:`\\Gamma` 点における調和基準座標で展開されます:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1017
msgid ""
"u_{0,\\mu}(\\kappa) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}}}\\sum_{j} "
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{0}j)\\, q_{0,j}."
msgstr ""
"u_{0,\\mu}(\\kappa) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}}}\\sum_{j} "
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{0}j)\\, q_{0,j}."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1021
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The three acoustic coordinates are a rigid translation and are excluded, "
"so :math:`3N_{\\kappa}-3` coordinates :math:`q_{0,j}` remain (written to "
"``PREFIX.atom_disp`` as :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}`);"
msgstr ""
"3 つの音響座標は剛体並進であるため除かれ、:math:`3N_{\\kappa}-3` 個の座標 :math:`q_{0,j}` が残ります "
"(:math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` として ``PREFIX.atom_disp`` に書き出されます)。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1024
msgid ""
"the **displacement gradient tensor** :math:`u_{\\mu\\nu}` (``RELAX_STR = "
"2``), which maps a position :math:`\\boldsymbol{r}` of the reference cell"
" to :math:`(I+u)\\boldsymbol{r}`. It is kept symmetric (the rigid "
"rotations are excluded), and its six independent components are written "
"to ``PREFIX.umn_tensor``. The energy is a function of the Green--Lagrange"
" strain :math:`\\eta = \\mathrm{sym}(u)+\\frac{1}{2}uu^{\\mathrm{T}}`."
msgstr ""
"**変位勾配テンソル** :math:`u_{\\mu\\nu}` (``RELAX_STR = 2``)。参照セル内の位置 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{r}` を :math:`(I+u)\\boldsymbol{r}` に写します。対称に保たれ "
"(剛体回転は除かれます)、独立な 6 成分が ``PREFIX.umn_tensor`` "
"に書き出されます。エネルギーはグリーン-ラグランジュひずみ :math:`\\eta = "
"\\mathrm{sym}(u)+\\frac{1}{2}uu^{\\mathrm{T}}` の関数です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1030
msgid "Potential energy surface at the deformed structure"
msgstr "変形した構造でのポテンシャルエネルギー曲面"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1032
msgid ""
"The potential energy is built in two steps. First, the strain dependence."
" The static energy of the homogeneously strained cell is expanded with "
"the elastic constants,"
msgstr "ポテンシャルエネルギーは 2 段階で構成されます。まず、ひずみ依存性です。一様にひずんだセルの静的エネルギーを弾性定数で展開します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1035
msgid ""
"U_{0}(u) = U_{\\mathrm{ref}} + "
"V\\sum_{\\mu\\nu}C_{\\mu\\nu}\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{V}{2}\\sum_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\\eta_{\\mu'\\nu'}"
"\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{V}{6}\\sum_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu',\\mu''\\nu''}C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu',\\mu''\\nu''}\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\\eta_{\\mu'\\nu'}\\eta_{\\mu''\\nu''}"
"\n"
"+ pV\\det(I+u),"
msgstr ""
"U_{0}(u) = U_{\\mathrm{ref}} + "
"V\\sum_{\\mu\\nu}C_{\\mu\\nu}\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{V}{2}\\sum_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\\eta_{\\mu'\\nu'}"
"\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{V}{6}\\sum_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu',\\mu''\\nu''}C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu',\\mu''\\nu''}\\eta_{\\mu\\nu}\\eta_{\\mu'\\nu'}\\eta_{\\mu''\\nu''}"
"\n"
"+ pV\\det(I+u),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1043
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`V` is the volume of the reference cell, :math:`C_{\\mu\\nu}`"
" is the residual stress of the reference structure, "
":math:`C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}` and "
":math:`C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu',\\mu''\\nu''}` are the clamped-ion second- "
"and third-order (Brugger) elastic constants, and :math:`p` is the "
"hydrostatic pressure ``STAT_PRESSURE``. Clamped-ion constants are used "
"because the internal coordinates are optimized explicitly. The IFCs of "
"the strained cell are expanded in the same way,"
msgstr ""
"ここで :math:`V` は参照セルの体積、:math:`C_{\\mu\\nu}` "
"は参照構造の残留応力、:math:`C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}` と "
":math:`C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu',\\mu''\\nu''}` はイオン固定 (clamped-ion) の 2 "
"次および 3 次の (Brugger) 弾性定数、:math:`p` は静水圧 ``STAT_PRESSURE`` "
"です。内部座標を陽に最適化するため、イオン固定の弾性定数を用います。ひずんだセルの IFC も同様に展開します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1048
msgid ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa; u) &= \\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa) + "
"\\sum_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa)}{\\partial "
"u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}}u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}\n"
"  + \\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\mu_1\\nu_1,\\mu_2\\nu_2}\\frac{\\partial^2 "
"\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa)}{\\partial u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}\\partial "
"u_{\\mu_2\\nu_2}}u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}u_{\\mu_2\\nu_2} + \\cdots, \\notag \\\\"
"\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}(u) &= \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2} + "
"\\sum_{\\mu\\nu}\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}}{\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu}}u_{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"  + \\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}\\frac{\\partial^2 "
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}}{\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}\\partial "
"u_{\\mu'\\nu'}}u_{\\mu\\nu}u_{\\mu'\\nu'}, \\notag \\\\\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3}(u) &= \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3} + "
"\\sum_{\\mu\\nu}\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3}}{\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu}}u_{\\mu\\nu}, \\notag\n"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa; u) &= \\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa) + "
"\\sum_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa)}{\\partial "
"u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}}u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}\n"
"  + \\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\mu_1\\nu_1,\\mu_2\\nu_2}\\frac{\\partial^2 "
"\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa)}{\\partial u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}\\partial "
"u_{\\mu_2\\nu_2}}u_{\\mu_1\\nu_1}u_{\\mu_2\\nu_2} + \\cdots, \\notag \\\\"
"\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}(u) &= \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2} + "
"\\sum_{\\mu\\nu}\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}}{\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu}}u_{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"  + \\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}\\frac{\\partial^2 "
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}}{\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}\\partial "
"u_{\\mu'\\nu'}}u_{\\mu\\nu}u_{\\mu'\\nu'}, \\notag \\\\\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3}(u) &= \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3} + "
"\\sum_{\\mu\\nu}\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3}}{\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu}}u_{\\mu\\nu}, \\notag\n"
"\\end{align}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1059
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where the atomic indices are omitted for brevity, and the quartic IFCs "
"are kept fixed (unless ``STRAIN_FC5 = 1``). The first-order term of "
":math:`\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa;u)` is the strain--force coupling, the force "
"acting on the atoms of a uniformly strained cell. It vanishes for atoms "
"on centrosymmetric sites, but not in general: in diamond, for instance, a"
" shear strain displaces the two sublattices against each other. A strain "
"derivative of the :math:`n`\\ th-order IFCs can be computed from the "
":math:`(n+1)`\\ th-order ones,"
msgstr ""
"ここで原子の添字は簡単のため省略しており、4 次の IFC は固定します (``STRAIN_FC5 = 1`` "
"の場合を除く)。:math:`\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa;u)` の 1 "
"次の項はひずみ-力結合、すなわち一様にひずんだセルで原子に働く力です。これは反転中心を持つサイトの原子では消えますが、一般にはゼロではありません。例えばダイヤモンドでは、せん断ひずみによって"
" 2 つの副格子が互いに逆向きに変位します。:math:`n` 次の IFC のひずみ微分は :math:`(n+1)` 次の IFC "
"から次のように計算できます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1065
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial "
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\cdots\\mu_n}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\dots;\\ell_n\\kappa_n)}{\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"= "
"\\sum_{\\ell\\kappa}\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\cdots\\mu_n\\mu}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\dots;\\ell_n\\kappa_n;\\ell\\kappa)\\,"
" r_{\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa),"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{\\partial "
"\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\cdots\\mu_n}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\dots;\\ell_n\\kappa_n)}{\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"= "
"\\sum_{\\ell\\kappa}\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\cdots\\mu_n\\mu}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\dots;\\ell_n\\kappa_n;\\ell\\kappa)\\,"
" r_{\\nu}(\\ell\\kappa),"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1070
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"as for the :ref:`Grüneisen parameters <formalism_gruneisen>`, or from DFT"
" calculations of strained supercells. Which source is used for :math:`C`,"
" for the strain--force coupling, and for "
":math:`\\partial\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}` is selected "
"by :ref:`STRAIN_COUPLING <anphon_strain_coupling>`. The terms "
":math:`\\partial^{2}\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}/\\partial u^{2}` and "
":math:`\\partial\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3}/\\partial u` are always "
"computed from the quartic IFCs, whereas the second and third strain "
"derivatives of :math:`\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa)` are included (computed from "
"the cubic and quartic IFCs) only when the tens digit of "
"``STRAIN_COUPLING`` is 2, and are zero otherwise."
msgstr ""
":ref:`グリュナイゼンパラメータ <formalism_gruneisen>` の場合と同様です。あるいは、ひずんだスーパーセルの DFT "
"計算から求めることもできます。:math:`C`、ひずみ-力結合、:math:`\\partial\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}/\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}` のそれぞれをどこから得るかは :ref:`STRAIN_COUPLING "
"<anphon_strain_coupling>` "
"で選択します。:math:`\\partial^{2}\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}/\\partial u^{2}` と "
":math:`\\partial\\Phi_{\\mu_1\\mu_2\\mu_3}/\\partial u` は常に 4 次の IFC "
"から計算されます。一方、:math:`\\Phi_{\\mu}(\\kappa)` の 2 次および 3 "
"次のひずみ微分は、``STRAIN_COUPLING`` の十の位が 2 の場合にのみ (3 次と 4 次の IFC から計算して) "
"含まれ、それ以外ではゼロです。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1077
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Second, the potential is re-expanded around the displaced atomic "
"positions. Writing :math:`\\Phi_{n}` for the strained IFCs of order "
":math:`n` and :math:`\\Phi_{n}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{k}` for the "
"contraction of :math:`k` of their indices with "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` (summed over all atoms of the supercell), the"
" IFCs at the structure :math:`(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0})` are"
msgstr ""
"次に、変位した原子位置のまわりでポテンシャルを展開し直します。ひずんだ :math:`n` 次の IFC を "
":math:`\\Phi_{n}`、その添字のうち :math:`k` 個を :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` "
"と縮約したもの (スーパーセルの全原子について和をとる) を "
":math:`\\Phi_{n}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{k}` と書くと、構造 "
":math:`(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0})` での IFC は次のようになります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1081
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{1} &= \\Phi_{1} + \\Phi_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\Phi_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{2} + "
"\\frac{1}{6}\\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{3}, &\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2} &= \\Phi_{2} + \\Phi_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{2}, \\notag \\\\\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{3} &= \\Phi_{3} + \\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}, &\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{4} &= \\Phi_{4}, \\notag\n"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{1} &= \\Phi_{1} + \\Phi_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\Phi_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{2} + "
"\\frac{1}{6}\\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{3}, &\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2} &= \\Phi_{2} + \\Phi_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{2}, \\notag \\\\\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{3} &= \\Phi_{3} + \\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}, &\n"
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{4} &= \\Phi_{4}, \\notag\n"
"\\end{align}"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1091
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"and the static energy becomes :math:`U_{0}(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}) = "
"U_{0}(u) + \\Phi_{1}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\Phi_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{2} + "
"\\frac{1}{6}\\Phi_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{3} + "
"\\frac{1}{24}\\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{4}`. Because the "
"potential is truncated at the fourth order in the displacements, this re-"
"expansion is exact within the model."
msgstr ""
"また、静的エネルギーは :math:`U_{0}(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}) = U_{0}(u) + "
"\\Phi_{1}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0} + "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\Phi_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{2} + "
"\\frac{1}{6}\\Phi_{3}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{3} + "
"\\frac{1}{24}\\Phi_{4}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}^{4}` となります。ポテンシャルは変位の 4 "
"次で打ち切られているため、この再展開はモデルの範囲内で厳密です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1096
msgid "Free energy and its gradients"
msgstr "自由エネルギーとその勾配"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1098
msgid "The free energy minimized at each temperature is"
msgstr "各温度で最小化する自由エネルギーは次式です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1100
msgid ""
"F(u, \\boldsymbol{u}_{0}, T) = U_{0}(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}) + "
"F_{\\mathrm{vib}}[\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}, \\tilde{\\Phi}_{4}; T]."
msgstr ""
"F(u, \\boldsymbol{u}_{0}, T) = U_{0}(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}) + "
"F_{\\mathrm{vib}}[\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}, \\tilde{\\Phi}_{4}; T]."

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1104
msgid ""
"In ``MODE = SCPH``, :math:`F_{\\mathrm{vib}}` is the SCP free energy "
"obtained by solving the :ref:`SCPH equation <formalism_SCPH>` with "
":math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` in place of the harmonic IFCs. In ``MODE = "
"QHA``, it is the harmonic free energy "
":math:`N_{q}^{-1}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}[\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/2"
" + k_{B}T\\ln(1-e^{-\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/k_{B}T})]` of the "
"frequencies obtained from :math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` alone. In this case "
"the quartic IFCs enter only through the renormalization of "
":math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` by :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` and :math:`u`."
msgstr ""
"``MODE = SCPH`` では、:math:`F_{\\mathrm{vib}}` は調和 IFC の代わりに "
":math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` を用いて :ref:`SCPH 方程式 <formalism_SCPH>` を解いて得られる"
" SCP 自由エネルギーです。``MODE = QHA`` では、:math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` "
"のみから得られる振動数による調和自由エネルギー "
":math:`N_{q}^{-1}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}[\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/2"
" + k_{B}T\\ln(1-e^{-\\hbar\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}/k_{B}T})]` です。この場合、4"
" 次の IFC は :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` と :math:`u` による "
":math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` のくりこみを通してのみ寄与します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1110
msgid ""
"The SCP free energy is variational, so its derivative with respect to any"
" parameter :math:`\\lambda` of the potential is the thermal average "
":math:`\\langle\\partial U/\\partial\\lambda\\rangle` with the SCP "
"(Gaussian) density matrix. The same holds for the QHA free energy, for "
"which :math:`\\partial F_{\\mathrm{vib}}/\\partial\\lambda = "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\partial\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}/\\partial\\lambda\\cdot\\langle\\boldsymbol{u}\\boldsymbol{u}\\rangle`."
" In both cases the gradients are"
msgstr ""
"SCP 自由エネルギーは変分的であるため、ポテンシャルの任意のパラメータ :math:`\\lambda` に関する微分は、SCP (ガウス型) "
"密度行列による熱平均 :math:`\\langle\\partial U/\\partial\\lambda\\rangle` "
"で与えられます。QHA の自由エネルギーについても同様で、:math:`\\partial "
"F_{\\mathrm{vib}}/\\partial\\lambda = "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\partial\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}/\\partial\\lambda\\cdot\\langle\\boldsymbol{u}\\boldsymbol{u}\\rangle`"
" が成り立ちます。いずれの場合も勾配は次式となります。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1115
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial u_{0,\\mu}(\\kappa)} &= "
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{\\mu}(\\kappa)\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\ell_1\\kappa_1\\nu,\\ell_2\\kappa_2\\lambda}\\tilde{\\Phi}_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda}(0\\kappa;\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\ell_2\\kappa_2)"
"\n"
"\\langle "
"u_{\\nu}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1)u_{\\lambda}(\\ell_2\\kappa_2)\\rangle, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}} &= \\frac{\\partial "
"U_{0}(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0})}{\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\ell_1\\kappa_1\\mu_1,\\ell_2\\kappa_2\\mu_2}\\frac{\\partial\\tilde{\\Phi}_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\ell_2\\kappa_2)}{\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"\\langle u_{\\mu_1}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1)u_{\\mu_2}(\\ell_2\\kappa_2)\\rangle,"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial u_{0,\\mu}(\\kappa)} &= "
"\\tilde{\\Phi}_{\\mu}(\\kappa)\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\ell_1\\kappa_1\\nu,\\ell_2\\kappa_2\\lambda}\\tilde{\\Phi}_{\\mu\\nu\\lambda}(0\\kappa;\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\ell_2\\kappa_2)"
"\n"
"\\langle "
"u_{\\nu}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1)u_{\\lambda}(\\ell_2\\kappa_2)\\rangle, \\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}} &= \\frac{\\partial "
"U_{0}(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0})}{\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"+ "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{\\ell_1\\kappa_1\\mu_1,\\ell_2\\kappa_2\\mu_2}\\frac{\\partial\\tilde{\\Phi}_{\\mu_1\\mu_2}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1;\\ell_2\\kappa_2)}{\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}}\n"
"\\langle u_{\\mu_1}(\\ell_1\\kappa_1)u_{\\mu_2}(\\ell_2\\kappa_2)\\rangle,"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1125
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"i.e. the force is the static force plus the thermal average of the cubic "
"term, and the stress is the static stress plus the vibrational (thermal "
"and zero-point) stress. With ``STRAIN_FC5 = 1`` the stress acquires the "
"additional term :math:`\\frac{1}{8}\\,\\partial\\Phi_{4}/\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu}\\cdot\\langle\\boldsymbol{u}\\boldsymbol{u}\\rangle\\langle\\boldsymbol{u}\\boldsymbol{u}\\rangle`."
" The displacement correlation function is evaluated from the SCP (or QHA)"
" phonons on the ``KMESH_SCPH`` (``KMESH_QHA``) mesh,"
msgstr ""
"すなわち、力は静的な力に 3 次の項の熱平均を加えたもの、応力は静的な応力に振動による応力 (熱的寄与と零点寄与) "
"を加えたものです。``STRAIN_FC5 = 1`` の場合、応力には追加の項 "
":math:`\\frac{1}{8}\\,\\partial\\Phi_{4}/\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu}\\cdot\\langle\\boldsymbol{u}\\boldsymbol{u}\\rangle\\langle\\boldsymbol{u}\\boldsymbol{u}\\rangle`"
" が加わります。変位相関関数は ``KMESH_SCPH`` (``KMESH_QHA``) メッシュ上の SCP (または QHA) "
"フォノンから評価します。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1131
msgid ""
"\\langle u_{\\mu}(\\ell\\kappa)u_{\\nu}(\\ell'\\kappa')\\rangle = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa'}}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\n"
"\\frac{\\hbar\\big[1+2n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})\\big]}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}\\,"
"\n"
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)\\,e^{*}_{\\nu}(\\kappa';\\boldsymbol{q}j)\\,"
"\n"
"e^{\\mathrm{i}\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell'))},"
msgstr ""
"\\langle u_{\\mu}(\\ell\\kappa)u_{\\nu}(\\ell'\\kappa')\\rangle = "
"\\frac{1}{N_{q}\\sqrt{M_{\\kappa}M_{\\kappa'}}}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}\n"
"\\frac{\\hbar\\big[1+2n(\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j})\\big]}{2\\omega_{\\boldsymbol{q}j}}\\,"
"\n"
"e_{\\mu}(\\kappa;\\boldsymbol{q}j)\\,e^{*}_{\\nu}(\\kappa';\\boldsymbol{q}j)\\,"
"\n"
"e^{\\mathrm{i}\\boldsymbol{q}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell)-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\ell'))},"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1138
msgid ""
"which is the matrix :math:`K_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` of the SCPH section "
"expressed in the atomic basis. When ``CLASSICAL = 1`` the factor "
":math:`\\hbar(1+2n)/2\\omega` is replaced by :math:`k_{B}T/\\omega^{2}`. "
"Imaginary modes on this mesh are excluded from the free energy but enter "
"the gradients with :math:`|\\omega|`, and a warning is printed."
msgstr ""
"これは SCPH の節の行列 :math:`K_{\\boldsymbol{q}}` を原子の基底で表したものです。``CLASSICAL = "
"1`` のときは因子 :math:`\\hbar(1+2n)/2\\omega` を :math:`k_{B}T/\\omega^{2}` "
"に置き換えます。このメッシュ上の虚数モードは自由エネルギーからは除かれますが、勾配には :math:`|\\omega|` "
"として含まれ、警告が出力されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1142
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The equilibrium structure satisfies :math:`\\partial F/\\partial q_{0,j} "
"= 0` for all optical coordinates and, with ``RELAX_STR = 2``, "
":math:`\\partial F/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu} = 0`. A symmetric structure is "
"a stationary point by symmetry, so a spontaneous symmetry breaking (e.g. "
"the ferroelectric transition of BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`) can only be obtained "
"from an initial structure that is already slightly distorted "
"(``&displace`` field, ``SET_INIT_STR``)."
msgstr ""
"平衡構造ではすべての光学座標について :math:`\\partial F/\\partial q_{0,j} = 0` "
"が、``RELAX_STR = 2`` の場合はさらに :math:`\\partial F/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu} = "
"0` が成り立ちます。対称な構造は対称性により停留点となるため、自発的な対称性の破れ (例えば BaTiO\\ :sub:`3` の強誘電転移) "
"は、わずかに歪ませた初期構造 (``&displace`` フィールド、``SET_INIT_STR``) から出発した場合にのみ得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1148
msgid "Optimization algorithm"
msgstr "最適化アルゴリズム"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1150
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"At each temperature, the following steps are repeated until the changes "
"of :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` and :math:`u` fall below "
"``COORD_CONV_TOL`` and ``CELL_CONV_TOL`` (and, when given, the gradients "
"below ``GRADIENT_CONV_TOL`` and ``CELL_GRADIENT_CONV_TOL``), or "
"``MAX_STR_ITER`` is reached:"
msgstr ""
"各温度で、:math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` と :math:`u` の変化が ``COORD_CONV_TOL`` と "
"``CELL_CONV_TOL`` を下回る (指定した場合はさらに勾配が ``GRADIENT_CONV_TOL`` と "
"``CELL_GRADIENT_CONV_TOL`` を下回る) か、``MAX_STR_ITER`` に達するまで、次の手順を繰り返します:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"the IFCs :math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{n}` are evaluated at the current "
"structure;"
msgstr "現在の構造で IFC :math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{n}` を評価する。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1155
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"the SCPH equation is solved (``MODE = SCPH``), or the dynamical matrix of"
" :math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` is diagonalized (``MODE = QHA``);"
msgstr ""
"SCPH 方程式を解く (``MODE = SCPH``)、または :math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}` の動力学行列を対角化する"
" (``MODE = QHA``)。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1156
msgid "the gradients :eq:`relax_gradients` are computed;"
msgstr "勾配 :eq:`relax_gradients` を計算する。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1157
msgid "the structure is updated."
msgstr "構造を更新する。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1159
msgid ""
"The update uses the state vector :math:`\\boldsymbol{x} = (q_{0,j}, "
"u_{\\mu\\nu})` and the gradient :math:`\\boldsymbol{g} = \\partial "
"F/\\partial\\boldsymbol{x}`. With the Newton-like method (``RELAX_ALGO = "
"2``, default), :math:`\\boldsymbol{x}\\leftarrow\\boldsymbol{x}-\\beta "
"H^{-1}\\boldsymbol{g}`. Here the coordinate block of :math:`H` is the "
":math:`\\Gamma`-point dynamical matrix of the current SCP (or QHA) "
"phonons in the basis of :math:`q_{0,j}`, plus "
":math:`\\omega_{\\mathrm{add}}^{2}` on the diagonal (``ADD_HESS_DIAG``) "
"to keep it positive near a soft-mode instability, and the cell block "
"consists of the second-order elastic constants :math:`V "
"C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}`. The coupling between the two blocks is "
"neglected, unless ``BUBBLE_HESS = 1`` provides the full curvature. The "
"mixing factors :math:`\\beta` are ``MIXBETA_COORD`` and ``MIXBETA_CELL``."
" ``RELAX_ALGO = 3`` starts a BFGS update from the same :math:`H` and "
"accelerates it with GDIIS, and ``RELAX_ALGO = 1`` is a plain steepest "
"descent of the internal coordinates only; it keeps the cell fixed even "
"when ``RELAX_STR = 2``."
msgstr ""
"更新には状態ベクトル :math:`\\boldsymbol{x} = (q_{0,j}, u_{\\mu\\nu})` と勾配 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{g} = \\partial F/\\partial\\boldsymbol{x}` "
"を用います。ニュートン法に類似した方法 (``RELAX_ALGO = 2``、既定) では "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{x}\\leftarrow\\boldsymbol{x}-\\beta "
"H^{-1}\\boldsymbol{g}` とします。ここで :math:`H` の座標ブロックは、現在の SCP (または QHA) "
"フォノンの :math:`\\Gamma` 点の動力学行列を :math:`q_{0,j}` "
"の基底で表したものに、ソフトモード不安定性の近くでも正定値に保つため対角成分に "
":math:`\\omega_{\\mathrm{add}}^{2}` (``ADD_HESS_DIAG``) を加えたもの、セルブロックは 2 "
"次の弾性定数 :math:`V C_{\\mu\\nu,\\mu'\\nu'}` です。``BUBBLE_HESS = 1`` "
"で完全な曲率を与える場合を除き、2 つのブロック間の結合は無視します。混合係数 :math:`\\beta` は "
"``MIXBETA_COORD`` と ``MIXBETA_CELL`` です。``RELAX_ALGO = 3`` は同じ :math:`H` "
"から BFGS 更新を始めて GDIIS で加速し、``RELAX_ALGO = 1`` "
"は内部座標のみの単純な最急降下法で、``RELAX_STR = 2`` の場合でもセルは固定されます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1171
msgid "Variants in ``MODE = QHA``"
msgstr "``MODE = QHA`` での変種"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1173
msgid ""
"The ``QHA_SCHEME`` tag selects how the conditions above are imposed when "
"the cell is relaxed (``RELAX_STR = 2``) [Masuki2023]_:"
msgstr ""
"``QHA_SCHEME`` タグは、セルを緩和する場合 (``RELAX_STR = 2``) に上の条件をどのように課すかを選択します "
"[Masuki2023]_:"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1175
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``QHA_SCHEME = 0`` minimizes :math:`F` with respect to both "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` and :math:`u` (full QHA)."
msgstr ""
"``QHA_SCHEME = 0`` は :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` と :math:`u` の両方について "
":math:`F` を最小化します (完全な QHA)。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1176
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``QHA_SCHEME = 1`` (zero static internal stress approximation, ZSISA): "
"the internal coordinates are determined by the static condition "
":math:`\\partial U_{0}/\\partial\\boldsymbol{q}_{0} = 0` at every strain,"
" and only the cell minimizes the free energy. The cell gradient is the "
"total derivative :math:`\\mathrm{d}F/\\mathrm{d}u_{\\mu\\nu} = \\partial "
"F/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu} + \\sum_{j}(\\partial F/\\partial "
"q_{0,j})(\\partial q_{0,j}/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu})`, with the internal-"
"strain response :math:`\\partial\\boldsymbol{q}_{0}/\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu} = "
"-\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}(\\Gamma)^{-1}\\,\\partial\\tilde{\\Phi}_{1}/\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}`."
msgstr ""
"``QHA_SCHEME = 1`` (zero static internal stress approximation, ZSISA): "
"内部座標は各ひずみで静的な条件 :math:`\\partial U_{0}/\\partial\\boldsymbol{q}_{0} = 0` "
"により決まり、自由エネルギーを最小化するのはセルのみです。セルの勾配は全微分 "
":math:`\\mathrm{d}F/\\mathrm{d}u_{\\mu\\nu} = \\partial F/\\partial "
"u_{\\mu\\nu} + \\sum_{j}(\\partial F/\\partial q_{0,j})(\\partial "
"q_{0,j}/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu})` で、内部ひずみ応答は "
":math:`\\partial\\boldsymbol{q}_{0}/\\partial u_{\\mu\\nu} = "
"-\\tilde{\\Phi}_{2}(\\Gamma)^{-1}\\,\\partial\\tilde{\\Phi}_{1}/\\partial"
" u_{\\mu\\nu}` です。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1181
msgid ""
"``QHA_SCHEME = 2`` (volumetric ZSISA, v-ZSISA): only the volume is "
"determined by the free energy. The cell shape and the internal "
"coordinates at a given volume follow from the static energy, i.e. the "
"vibrational stress acts only along the strain direction that changes "
":math:`\\det(I+u)` at the lowest static-energy cost (obtained with the "
"ZSISA elastic constants)."
msgstr ""
"``QHA_SCHEME = 2`` (volumetric ZSISA, v-ZSISA): "
"自由エネルギーで決まるのは体積のみです。与えられた体積でのセル形状と内部座標は静的エネルギーから決まります。すなわち、振動による応力は、:math:`\\det(I+u)`"
" を最小の静的エネルギーで変化させるひずみの方向 (ZSISA の弾性定数で求めます) にのみ働きます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1186
msgid ""
"``RELAX_STR = 3`` (``MODE = QHA`` only) is the lowest-order perturbative "
"solution of the same problem: the gradients of :math:`F_{\\mathrm{vib}}` "
"are evaluated once with the harmonic phonons of the reference structure, "
"and the structural change is obtained from a single linear solve with the"
" static Hessian (optical :math:`\\Gamma` modes and elastic constants), "
"without iteration."
msgstr ""
"``RELAX_STR = 3`` (``MODE = QHA`` のみ) "
"は同じ問題の最低次の摂動解です。:math:`F_{\\mathrm{vib}}` の勾配を参照構造の調和フォノンで 1 "
"度だけ評価し、静的なヘッセ行列 (:math:`\\Gamma` 点の光学モードと弾性定数) による 1 "
"回の線形方程式の求解で、反復なしに構造変化を求めます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1191
msgid ""
"``RELAX_STR = 4`` keeps the strain fixed at the value of the ``&strain`` "
"field and relaxes only :math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}`. The resulting "
":math:`\\bar{F}(u,T) = "
"\\min_{\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}}F(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0},T)` can be "
"differentiated numerically with respect to the strain to obtain the "
"isothermal elastic constants at finite temperature."
msgstr ""
"``RELAX_STR = 4`` はひずみを ``&strain`` "
"フィールドの値に固定し、:math:`\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}` のみを緩和します。得られる "
":math:`\\bar{F}(u,T) = "
"\\min_{\\boldsymbol{u}_{0}}F(u,\\boldsymbol{u}_{0},T)` "
"をひずみについて数値微分すると、有限温度での等温弾性定数が得られます。"

#: ../../source/anphondir/formalism_anphon.rst:1195
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The relaxed structure (and the IFCs :math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{3}`, "
":math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{4}` at that structure) can be used in subsequent "
"phonon and thermal conductivity calculations through "
":ref:`RELAXED_STRUCTURE <anphon_relaxed_structure>`."
msgstr ""
"緩和した構造 (およびその構造での IFC "
":math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{3}`、:math:`\\tilde{\\Phi}_{4}`) "
"は、:ref:`RELAXED_STRUCTURE <anphon_relaxed_structure>` "
"により、その後のフォノン計算や熱伝導率計算に用いることができます。"

